button\n  - InputPanel now uses useSetAtom(debugLogAtom) for write-only access\n\nH-3: Centralise magic numbers in src/constants/config.ts\n  - PBKDF2_ITERATIONS, SESSION_TIMEOUT_MS, ENCRYPT_DEBOUNCE_MS\n  - MAX_UNLOCK_ATTEMPTS, LOCKOUT_DURATION_MS, API_TIMEOUT_MS\n  - COUNT_TOKENS_TIMEOUT_MS, MAX_DEBUG_LOG_LINES, MCP_POLL_INTERVAL_MS\n  - Applied across crypto.ts, useSessionTimeout, useApiKeyEncryption,\n    useTokenCounter, useGeminiApi, InputPanel, FigmaMcpPanel\n\nH-4: Unify error reporting pattern\n  - ErrorBoundary.componentDidCatch now calls reportError(''ErrorBoundary'', error)\n  - useApiKeyEncryption encryption failure uses reportError instead of console.error\n\nAll 87 tests pass, production build successful.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d18f84b518ce6a6170e5a97f3b749067cde425f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/birdea/ifigmalab/git/trees/8d18f84b518ce6a6170e5a97f3b749067cde425f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/birdea/ifigmalab/git/commits/7f096d9e70924c54e7a2850dcdb86811121c45d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4962418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/birdea","id":4962418,"login":"birdea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjI0MTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/subscription