other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/birdea","id":4962418,"login":"birdea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjI0MTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/birdea/ifigmalab/commits/7bdde9bcb145b2dd9eec8ef950c5e79f6d70c543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T17:30:22Z","email":"birdea@gmail.com","name":"birdea"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T17:30:22Z","email":"birdea@gmail.com","name":"birdea"},"message":"feat: complete Sprint 11 - performance, arch, a11y, and code quality improvements\n\nSprint 11 이슈 7건 처리:\n\n- P-06: Gemini 모델 목록 sessionStorage TTL 캐싱 추가 (1시간)\n  - useGeminiModels.ts에 캐시 히트 경로 구현, API 재호출 최소화\n  - STORAGE_KEYS.GEMINI_MODELS_CACHE 상수 사용\n\n- A-09: SYSTEM_PROMPT 외부화 (config/prompts.ts 분리)\n  - utils.ts에서 SYSTEM_PROMPT 추출, re-export 구조로 호환성 유지\n  - process.env.SYSTEM_PROMPT 오버라이드 지원 (A/B 테스트 가능)\n  - webpack DefinePlugin에 SYSTEM_PROMPT, MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS 추가\n\n- A-10: bootstrap.tsx에 전역 에러 핸들러 추가\n  - unhandledrejection, error 이벤트 핸들러로 비동기 오류 수집\n\n- A11Y-01: FigmaMcpPanel 이모지 버튼 aria-hidden 처리\n  - 📸, ✕ 이모지를 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">로 래핑\n  - 스크린리더 중복 낭독 문제 해결\n\n- A11Y-02: 탭 방향키 내비게이션 구현 (WAI-ARIA 탭 패턴)\n  - App.tsx 탭 버튼에 onKeyDown 핸들러 추가\n  - ArrowRight/ArrowLeft로 탭 간 순환 이동 지원\n\n- Q-18: MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS 환경 변수화\n  - useAgentSubmit.ts: process.env.MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS로 외부화\n  - 기본값 65536 유지\n\n- Q-19: 스토리지 키 상수 파일 통합 (constants/storageKeys.ts)\n  - STORAGE_KEYS 상수로 매직 스트링 제거\n  - S-10(레거시 평문 키 즉시 삭제) 동시 처리\n\n테스트: 58 passed, 브랜치 커버리지 70.42% (임계값 70% 충족)\n신규 테스트: prompts.test.ts(env 오버라이드), utils/utils.test.ts(formatBytes 전분기)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9c9c6097365472b450c8ee7cc7ea24f6ba0ba76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/birdea/ifigmalab/git/trees/9c9c6097365472b450c8ee7cc7ea24f6ba0ba76e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/birdea/ifigmalab/git/commits/7bdde9bcb145b2dd9eec8ef950c5e79f6d70c543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4962418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/birdea","id":4962418,"login":"birdea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjI0MTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/birdea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/birdea/ifigmalab/commit/7bdde9bcb145b2dd9eec8ef950c5e79f6d70c543","node_id":"C_kwDORZebM9oAKDdiZGRlOWJjYjE0NWIyZGQ5ZWVjOGVmOTUwYzVlNzlmNmQ3MGM1NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/birdea/ifigmalab/commit/c76415aa7d5c8ada6aa037ae2a5f14533c7996b6","sha":"c76415aa7d5c8ada6aa037ae2a5f14533c7996b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/birdea/ifigmalab/commits/c76415aa7d5c8ada6aa037ae2a5f14533c7996b6"}],"sha":"7bdde9bcb145b2dd9eec8ef950c5e79f6d70c543","url":"https://a