hub.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/4ceb08e74ac8d3d3ef8072534f934729ccf28f0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T15:08:32Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T15:08:32Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"message":"cursor-templates: один источник правды, без воды и коллизий\n\nПравило (rules/react-graph.mdc):\n- Убрана вода: удалены длинные сценарные примеры и программный API.\n- Один источник правды: контракты CLI, модель графа, troubleshooting только здесь.\n- Режимы: отказ от субагента не переключает на skill; skill только по явному «use skill».\n- find: явно указано, что поиск по имени экспорта (идентификатор после # в nodeId).\n- who-uses: при package:* в users — раскрывать через node-info (who-uses без --resolve-packages).\n- Корень монорепо: команда поиска, если путь неизвестен.\n- Типичный flow: схема для двух входов (путь известен / только имя) и раскрытия package:*.\n\nSkill (skills/react-graph.mdc):\n- Активация только по явному запросу («используй скил», «use skill»).\n- Шаги 0–3 без дублирования; явный критерий остановки (Шаг 3).\n- Та же логика find и who-uses + package:*; ссылка на rule для контрактов.\n\nАгент (agents/graph-agent.md):\n- Flow 1–6: build → nodeId (path/find) → команды → раскрытие package:* → остановка → ответ.\n- Stopping condition: когда достаточно directDependencies/users; transitive только для bundle.\n- find по имени экспорта; who-uses + package:* через node-info.\n- Корень монорепо: та же команда поиска.\n\nПрочие изменения: README, STATUS.mdc, bin/cli.ts, docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"073e1ec24ed969195bf4898cc44354731dc01796","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/trees/073e1ec24ed969195bf4898cc44354731dc01796"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/commits/4ceb08e74ac8d3d3ef8072534f934729ccf28f0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/4ceb08e74ac8d3d3ef8072534f934729ccf28f0e","node_id":"C_kwDORZhL5toAKDRjZWIwOGU3NGFjOGQzZDNlZjgwNzI1MzRmOTM0NzI5Y2NmMjhmMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/7cdc7546a9e89c384dd90cb393e7a3ec7bed5b07","sha":"7cdc7546a9e89c384dd90cb393e7a3ec7bed5b07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/7cdc7546a9e89c384dd90cb393e7a3ec7bed5b07"}],"sha":"4ceb08e74ac8d3d3ef8072534f934729ccf28f0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commi