://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/3c87dee5c23b63118742976d59cc9f4ebaff31d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T14:42:10Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T14:42:10Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"message":"Исправление резолва re-export для symbol-узлов и обновление документации\n\nПроблема:\n- who-uses для symbol-узлов возвращал пустой массив, если символ импортировался через barrel (re-export)\n- deps и node-info показывали 0 зависимостей на уровне символов\n- Рёбра calls/uses_jsx не создавались при импорте из barrel-файлов\n\nРешение:\n- Парсер: добавлен сбор re-export деклараций (TReExport, reExports в ParsedModule, collectReExports)\n- GraphBuilder: новый проход resolveReExports с резолвом цепочек barrel→barrel→file и защитой от циклов\n- createResolveImportedSymbol учитывает fileReExportedSymbols при резолве символов\n- Поддержаны export { X } from ''path'', export *, цепочки re-export\n\nДокументация:\n- README: уточнено, что на уровне symbol импорты через barrel корректно резолвятся\n- STATUS: раздел «Исправление резолва re-export», обновлены «Что работает хорошо» и ограничения\n- cursor-templates: правило (типы рёбер), агент (ограничения barrel), без изменений skill\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"fb017e900934b988a653b64dce2081e89e98b271","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/trees/fb017e900934b988a653b64dce2081e89e98b271"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/commits/3c87dee5c23b63118742976d59cc9f4ebaff31d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/3c87dee5c23b63118742976d59cc9f4ebaff31d9","node_id":"C_kwDORZhL5toAKDNjODdkZWU1YzIzYjYzMTE4NzQyOTc2ZDU5Y2M5ZjRlYmFmZjMxZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61","sha":"2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61"}],"sha":"3c87dee5c23b63118742976d59cc9f4ebaff31d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/3c87dee5c23b63118742976d59cc9f4ebaff31d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T14:19:17Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T14:19:17Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"message":"feat(find): частичный поиск, фильтр по слайсу и подсказки при нулевом результате\n\nРасширение команды find в react-graph CLI:\n\n- --partial / -p: поиск по подстроке имени символа вместо точного совпадения\n  (find \"Gantt\" --partial находит GanttModuleApp, useGanttSharedState и т.д.)\n\n- --slice <name>: фильтр по FSD-слайсу (entityDrawer, projectData) для сужения\n  внутри слоя; комбинируется с --layer, --mf, --kind\n\n- При count: 0 и точном поиске — автоматические подсказки: поле suggestions\n  в JSON (до 5 кандидатов по подстроке); в текстовом режиме «Did you mean?»\n  и совет использовать --partial\n\nДокументация: README (опции find, примеры), STATUS.mdc (раздел 2026-03),\ncursor-templates (graph-agent, rules, skills) обновлены под новый API.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"8b70018e2f2f5c5ad01a3b0eb050776220e00fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/trees/8b70018e2f2f5c5ad01a3b0eb050776220e00fba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/commits/2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61","node_id":"C_kwDORZhL5toAKDJlMTdlMmE5ZmNkNmY1YWZjMDFjYzEzMDUwZmE1Y2YzNDE3MGJhNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/21b2d608fec2dff6a5c3e3c019359cde110dec55","sha":"21b2d608fec2dff6a5c3e3c019359cde110dec55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/21b2d608fec2dff6a5c3e3c019359cde110dec55"}],"sha":"2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/2e17e2a9fcd6f5afc01cc13050fa5cf34170ba61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/21b2d608fec2dff6a5c3e3c019359cde110dec55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T13:46:31Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T13:46:31Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"message":"cursor-templates: интеграция find, оптимизация и документирование\n\nПравило (rules/react-graph.mdc):\n- Добавлен раздел «Практические примеры flow»: поиск компонента по имени,\n  impact-анализ shared-модуля, состав entry-файла страницы\n- Добавлен раздел «Программный API»: buildGraph, loadGraph, QueryEngine,\n  когда использовать CLI vs программный API\n- Команда find добавлена в «Когда граф ОБЯЗАТЕЛЕН»\n- Fallback для локальной разработки перенесён в troubleshooting\n- Унифицирована нотация package:@digest/*\n\nSkill (skills/react-graph.mdc):\n- В «Шаг 1» добавлен поиск символа по имени через find с примерами\n  и флагами --layer, --mf, --kind\n- Убраны fallback-команды\n- Убрана шуточная формулировка, заменена на нейтральное уведомление\n- Сокращено дублирование: ссылка на полные контракты в rule\n- В жёсткие правила добавлено: при поиске символа — сначала find\n\nСубагент (agents/graph-agent.md):\n- Убрана конкретная модель из frontmatter (наследование от родителя)\n- В «Шаг 2» добавлен сценарий поиска по имени символа через find\n- Убраны fallback-команды\n- Добавлен раздел «Известные ограничения»: symbol-граф, router config,\n  barrel-файлы, конфиги/декларации\n- В жёсткие правила добавлено: при поиске символа — сначала find\n\nSTATUS.mdc:\n- Добавлена секция «Cursor-templates: доработка и оптимизация (2026-03)»\n  с перечислением всех изменений и итогом\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"3eb0c96f5e6973e0e748321f67975a2f98ecbd40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/trees/3eb0c96f5e6973e0e748321f67975a2f98ecbd40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/commits/21b2d608fec2dff6a5c3e3c019359cde110dec55","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/oth