t-анализ 9/10, состав страницы 9/10,\n  роутинг/рефакторинг/API-изменения 8/10 и т.д.)\n- Добавлен фрейм «граф — карта, а не полная модель; сначала граф, потом точечное чтение»\n- Модель графа переведена в таблицы (узлы и рёбра) без TS-типов\n- Cursor-интеграция выделена в отдельный раздел с описанием трёхфайловой схемы\n- README сжат с 435 до 254 строк при сохранении всей актуальной информации\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"ee8ac8ee6a1206ccd1c3a9f79bf48eff5e2e2c64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/trees/ee8ac8ee6a1206ccd1c3a9f79bf48eff5e2e2c64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/commits/9bacbe4513389149f3eb841bc1d0db2d821e1ebf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/9bacbe4513389149f3eb841bc1d0db2d821e1ebf","node_id":"C_kwDORZhL5toAKDliYWNiZTQ1MTMzODkxNDlmM2ViODQxYmMxZDBkYjJkODIxZTFlYm