goleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commits/62ff586e0a0c4b0b9ac3f11de1c51ae2ad464810/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-08T11:14:47Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-08T11:14:47Z","email":"gogolevaa@lad24.ru","name":"Гоголев Алексей"},"message":"refactor: код-ревью, константы, декомпозиция, документация, README и STATUS\n\n- Удаление gantt-app: убрано исключение services/gantt-app из projectScanner,\n  react-graph.mdc и STATUS.mdc (модуль снят с поддержки).\n\n- Константы и конфиг: добавлен src/config/constants.ts — вынесены FSD-слои,\n  префиксы id (package:, project:, symbol:), INTERNAL_PACKAGE_PREFIXES,\n  TSCONFIG_FILENAME, пути роутера и поля маршрутов, LAZY_FACTORY_NAME,\n  расширения и исключения сканера, regex/расширения для AST, Cursor paths.\n  Все затронутые модули переведены на импорт из констант.\n\n- Декомпозиция graphBuilder: buildProjectGraph разбит на createInitialNodes,\n  addPackageJsonDependencies, addImportAndSymbolNodes, addSymbolToSymbolEdges,\n  addRouterConfigPackages; вынесены createResolveImportedSymbol и resolveSymbolTarget.\n\n- Декомпозиция astParser: getExportKindFromModifiers, buildSymbolInfo;\n  разбор импортов вынесен в pushImportFrom* (ImportDeclaration, ExportDeclaration,\n  require, dynamic import).\n\n- pathResolver: parseTsConfigWithComments, resolvePathsWithBaseUrl; общий парсер\n  для loadTsConfigPaths и loadTsConfigBaseUrl.\n\n- routerConfigParser: parseRouteObjectLiteral; collectRouteEntries делегирует\n  разбор объекта и рекурсию по массивам.\n\n- CLI: обработчики handleBuild, handleDeps, handleWhoUses, handleNodeInfo,\n  handleInitCursor; printHelp дополнен опциями --resolve-packages, -R, --files-only, -f.\n\n- Документация: @fileoverview и JSDoc по модулям; @param/@returns для buildGraph,\n  loadGraph, QueryEngine и методов.\n\n- README: имя пакета mf-mono-project-graph и CLI react-graph, путь init-cursor\n  .cursor/skills/react-graph.mdc, обновлена структура (config, routerConfigParser),\n  актуальные примеры API.\n\n- STATUS.mdc: секция «Рефакторинг и документация» с описанием выполненной работы.\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"e163031640a1577935c93b1070e2fef4dd8b29ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/trees/e163031640a1577935c93b1070e2fef4dd8b29ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/git/commits/62ff586e0a0c4b0b9ac3f11de1c51ae2ad464810","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96118418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MayakGogoleva","id":96118418,"login":"MayakGogoleva","node_id":"U_kgDOBbqmkg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MayakGogoleva","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AlekseyGogolev/graph_agent/commit/62ff586e0a0c4b0b9ac3f11de1c51ae2ad46