epo''s own file:line citations (used throughout eval assertions and CI parity checks) are stable under single-line editing but cascade under hard-wrap. There was no prior consistent convention -- most files, including the product SKILL.md files, were hard-wrapped. Frozen benchmark evidence (field-scan-v1) and files pinned by sha256 in currently-running or pending benchmark protocols are explicitly excluded.\n\nIncludes CHANGELOG.md and the coordinating fix to scripts/ci/test-parity.sh''s mutation test, which pins a literal substring from this file and must stay in the same commit as any reflow of it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cesovo4fM6aN3XcNoH887Q","tree":{"sha":"f3a95659310289dcad91345a723cdbf521ecde06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voidmatcha/e2e-skills/git/trees/f3a95659310289dcad91345a723cdbf521ecde06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voidmatcha/e2e-skills/git/commits/8936f6b917904726de2023b31f3183a62a90b563","verification":{"payload":"tree f3a95659310289dcad91345a723cdbf521ecde06\nparent 56f0a5938165689db70c7f0a81dc2a0c4bc3b408\nauthor YONGJAE LEE <16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com> 1789194285 +0900\ncommitter YONGJAE LEE <16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com> 1789194285 +0900\n\nReflow markdown prose to one line per paragraph, repo-wide\n\nThis repo''s own file:line citations (used throughout eval assertions and CI parity checks) are stable under single-line editing but cascade under hard-wrap. There was no prior consistent convention -- most files, including the product SKILL.md files, were hard-wrapped. Frozen benchmark evidence (field-scan-v1) and files pinned by sha256 in currently-running or pending benchmark protocols are explicitly excluded.\n\nIncludes CHANGELOG.md and the coordinating fix to scripts/ci/test-parity.sh''s mutation test, which pins a literal substring from this file and must stay in the same commit as any reflow of it.\n\nCo