epos/voidmatcha/e2e-skills/commits/c5e331b88d5b6488aea3adbe873d529c02a44a79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T01:55:08Z","email":"16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YONGJAE LEE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T01:55:08Z","email":"16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YONGJAE LEE"},"message":"Complete the field-scan-v1 sample''s two timeout repositories\n\nRun a separately disclosed no-cutoff, hard-ceiling-limit scanner protocol\nagainst ever-co/ever-gauzy and open-mercato/open-mercato, the two\nfield-scan-v1 rows that recorded status: timeout, and record the\nreconciled results without modifying the frozen v1 ledger.\n\nConstraint: the frozen field-scan-v1 ledger and its own stated claims are\nnever rewritten by this extension.\n\nRejected: merging the extension''s results into the v1 ledger as if the\noriginal 30-minute protocol had completed; treating a manually-stopped\nstalled attempt as a proven scanner defect without corroborating evidence.\n\nConfidence: medium\n\nScope-risk: benchmark evidence documentation and the field-scan-v1-extension\nrunner script; no product code (scan.sh, skills) changed.\n\nNot-tested: whether the attempt-2/attempt-4 stalls were genuinely resource\ncontention rather than a latent scan.sh defect remains unconfirmed from the\ncommitted record alone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cesovo4fM6aN3XcNoH887Q","tree":{"sha":"4b895b3e94aa994e1b35d7cf41b3dc46404895b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voidmatcha/e2e-skills/git/trees/4b895b3e94aa994e1b35d7cf41b3dc46404895b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voidmatcha/e2e-skills/git/commits/c5e331b88d5b6488aea3adbe873d529c02a44a79","verification":{"payload":"tree 4b895b3e94aa994e1b35d7cf41b3dc46404895b4\nparent c444534ddb9dc9c4a7bea0aabef38b5950922c75\nauthor YONGJAE LEE <16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com> 1789091708 +0900\ncommitter YONGJAE LEE <16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com> 1789091708 +0900\n\nComplete the field-scan-v1 sample''s two timeout repositories\n\nRun a separately disclosed no-cutoff, hard-ceiling-limit scanner protocol\nagainst ever-co/ever-gauzy and open-mercato/open-mercato, the two\nfield-scan-v1 rows that recorded status: timeout, and record the\nreconciled results without modifying the frozen v1 ledger.\n\nConstraint: the frozen field-scan-v1 ledger and its own stated claims are\nnever rewritten by this extension.\n\nRejected: merging the extension''s results into the v1 ledger as if the\noriginal 30-minute protocol had completed; treating a manually-stopped\nstalled attempt as a proven scanner defect without corroborating evidence.\n\nConfidence: medium\n\nScope-risk: benchmark evidence documentation and the field-scan-v1-extension\nrunner script; no product code (scan.sh, skills) changed.\n\nNot-tested: whether the attempt-2/attempt-4 stalls were genuinely resource\ncontention rather than a latent scan.sh defect remains unconfirmed from the\ncommitted record alone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cesovo4fM6aN3XcNoH887Q\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgnIl72o4wKEtDd2pGWzPrS4+Aq1\nc8FhqMeVyeHxawsKEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKO1YI1+OpdIqGJCCUT3OprTfvGH17QzvmJecjeWXFXUKW6qsKjOU4ixUyPxTIUvxB\nLcTSxLjLBSJW9kSCS7ZQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-11T01:55:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16266103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","h