:27Z","email":"16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com","name":"YONGJAE LEE"},"message":"Release 1.15.1: expand review coverage and streamline CI\n\nAdd assertion-loop and reason-less-skip review candidates with fixtures and\nscanner triage. Document the AI-generated test review workflow, clarify\nframework-tool positioning, add supported Playwright trace guidance, and add\nlinked Kimi feature proof to every localized README. Polish the Korean README\nwhere sentence relationships or translated phrasing obscured the source.\n\nBump all host manifests and skill metadata to 1.15.1. Report CI stage timings,\nremove redundant parity work, and harden load-sensitive process-cleanup checks\nwithout weakening their cleanup assertions.\n\nConstraint: keep canonical CI, security, scope, and evidence gates fail-closed.\n\nRejected: increase scanner worker count; it measured slower under current host\nload.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: new heuristic candidates can add non-gating triage output; CI timing\nchanges affect scheduling only.\n\nNot-tested: live Playwright 1.59 trace commands and external model benchmark\nreruns.","tree":{"sha":"d74fcb586a3aa662aec3e528c53a62f15d8848da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voidmatcha/e2e-skills/git/trees/d74fcb586a3aa662aec3e528c53a62f15d8848da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voidmatcha/e2e-skills/git/commits/241b5cd6c328ccb4e9487e1aaa0196220402c544","verification":{"payload":"tree d74fcb586a3aa662aec3e528c53a62f15d8848da\nparent 3dd88ca92be45f2545b0a8a2e69d41c83005dd0c\nauthor YONGJAE LEE <16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com> 1788275782 +0900\ncommitter YONGJAE LEE <16266103+voidmatcha@users.noreply.github.com> 1788287847 +0900\n\nRelease 1.15.1: expand review coverage and streamline CI\n\nAdd assertion-loop and reason-less-skip review candidates with fixtures and\nscanner triage. Document the AI-generated test review workflow, clarify\nframework-tool positioning, add supported Playwright trace guidance, and add\nlinked Kimi feature proof to every localized README. Polish the Korean README\nwhere sentence relationships or translated phrasing obscured the source.\n\nBump all host manifests and skill metadata to 1.15.1. Report CI stage timings,\nremove redundant parity work, and harden load-sensitive process-cleanup checks\nwithout weakening their cleanup assertions.\n\nConstraint: keep canonical CI, security, scope, and evidence gates fail-closed.\n\nRejected: increase scanner worker count; it measured slower under current host\nload.\n\nConfidence: high\n\nScope-risk: new heuristic candidates can add non-gating triage output; CI timing\nchanges affect scheduling only.\n\nNot-tested: live Playwright 1.59 trace commands and external model benchmark\nreruns.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgnIl72o4wKEtDd2pGWzPrS4+Aq1\nc8FhqMeVyeHxawsKEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQACjsDIzDf+PoQso2UlMDxWDZU3H69YXzg6V/DaZDKiJlC5batRKDokpn1JFyrHKdg\n3ZqGXOlGXN9zau9GTGAAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T18:38:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16266103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/voidmatcha","id":16266103,"login":"voidmatcha","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjY2MTAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voidmatcha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/us