026-02-27T07:29:47Z","email":"pixox24@Gmail.com","name":"DopaGen Developer"},"message":"feat: add task timer, fixed layout, and enhanced image details\n\n- Add timer to queue thumbnails (top-right, 9px, shows seconds)\n- Fix left/right panel height to 700px with scrollable content\n- Enhance image detail modal with: generation time, duration, parameters\n- Improve Recreate to restore all original settings including model, aspect ratio, quality, and form state\n- Add modelId and duration fields to GeneratedImage type\n\nFeatures:\n1. Queue timer shows elapsed time during generation, final duration when completed (green badge)\n2. Both panels fixed at 700px height, left panel scrolls for long forms\n3. Detail page shows complete generation info: Prompt, Negative Prompt, Resolution, Model, Duration, Timestamp, Parameters\n4. Recreate preserves all original parameters, falls back to current model if original unavailable","tree":{"sha":"0cddf3b157be008067823192334a282ad8567b55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixox24/Dopagen-ai/git/trees/0cddf3b157be008067823192334a282ad8567b55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixox24/Dopagen-ai/git/commits/d618e3a88e4bfc26da9e2437570b91c02b7020c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179659151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pixox24","id":179659151,"login":"pixox24","node_id":"U_kgDOCrVhjw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/repos","site_admin":fa