76397c400a8af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T16:41:35Z","email":"pixox24@gmail.com","name":"lifenghua"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T16:41:35Z","email":"pixox24@gmail.com","name":"lifenghua"},"message":"Migrate to Supabase Edge Functions (Hybrid Architecture)\n\nMajor Changes:\n- Create Supabase Edge Function for AI image generation (/functions/v1/generate)\n- Replace Express backend API calls with Supabase Client queries\n- Update services/api.ts to use Edge Functions for generation\n- Remove dependency on external backend server\n\nArchitecture:\n- Frontend (Vercel) → Edge Function → Supabase Database\n- BizyAir API Key securely stored in Supabase Secrets\n- All data queries use Supabase Client directly\n\nFiles Added:\n- supabase/functions/generate/index.ts - Edge Function implementation\n- supabase/config.toml - Supabase CLI configuration\n- docs/edge-function-deployment.md - Deployment guide\n- docs/supabase-edge-functions-migration-plan.md - Migration plan\n\nFiles Modified:\n- services/api.ts - Updated to use Edge Functions\n- pages/Generate.tsx - Fixed submitGenerationTask call\n\nBenefits:\n- No Railway/other backend needed\n- Secure API key storage\n- Reduced infrastructure complexity\n- Cost-effective serverless architecture","tree":{"sha":"57b3097d27debe3b9a915b48caa5ac08067aeedf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixox24/Dopagen-ai/git/trees/57b3097d27debe3b9a915b48caa5ac08067aeedf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pixox24/Dopagen-ai/git/commits/10aec311596fb103a22fb5d867c76397c400a8af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179659151?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixox24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu