:"2026-02-26T23:19:50Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T23:19:50Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"message":"fix(server): use unique session key per request to prevent gateway bloat\n\nEach generation request now gets its own gateway session key instead of\nreusing a shared one. This prevents message accumulation that caused\nincreasingly slow responses and eventual timeouts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83dc50ee3e3a339ac85dfb2222803b538b287bf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/trees/83dc50ee3e3a339ac85dfb2222803b538b287bf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/commits/a7c392befa1cd6b5d1c274134d1a64d98b0e4f86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/a7c392befa1cd6b5d1c274134d1a64d98b0e4f86","node_id":"C_kwDORZxKsNoAKGE3YzM5MmJlZmExY2Q2YjVkMWMyNzQxMzRkMWE2NGQ5OGIwZTRmODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae","sha":"85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae"}],"sha":"a7c392befa1cd6b5d1c274134d1a64d98b0e4f86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/a7c392befa1cd6b5d1c274134d1a64d98b0e4f86"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T21:42:28Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T21:42:28Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"message":"feat(ui): soft editorial redesign — warm neutrals, dissolved cards, serif typography\n\nComplete visual overhaul from dark sci-fi HUD to editorial magazine aesthetic:\n- Fonts: Source Serif 4 (display) + DM Sans (body) + JetBrains Mono (code)\n- Colors: warm off-white (#f8f6f3), near-black text, terracotta accent\n- Cards dissolved: content floats on page, no backgrounds/borders on most blocks\n- Container children (section/row/column) get subtle white surface + thin border\n- Section headings: thin ruled line with small uppercase sans label\n- Metrics: large serif numerals with small uppercase label above\n- Controls: pill-shaped input/buttons, dark filled Generate button\n- Images: rounded corners, no card chrome\n- Status bar: simple text line, no sweep animation\n- Centered 1120px content column with generous whitespace\n- Subtle SVG paper-grain texture on background\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e21d7017a7c970a276c9e4b0e1ebbe42efb22af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/trees/7e21d7017a7c970a276c9e4b0e1ebbe42efb22af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/commits/85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae","node_id":"C_kwDORZxKsNoAKDg1MDE1ZjY1YjZhNjU5MGI0MDc2ZmUxOGQ5Yjk3YWE3NzNhYjRmYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f","sha":"c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f"}],"sha":"85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/85015f65b6a6590b4076fe18d9b97aa773ab4fae"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T21:42:15Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T21:42:15Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"message":"refactor(ui): prepare markup for editorial redesign\n\n- Remove hud-card class from header and controls (no longer panel-styled)\n- Switch default theme from dark to light\n- Rename state badge from chip to state-label\n- Metric renderer: h3 → p.metric-label for editorial hierarchy\n- List renderer: conditional title, add type-list class for styling hooks\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"653741204d4be1f9bb93c27d109bf2fb1b813c10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/trees/653741204d4be1f9bb93c27d109bf2fb1b813c10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/commits/c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f","node_id":"C_kwDORZxKsNoAKGM5MmM3YmM4NmZhZWU4MjExYjc2Njc1NzY3YjNkOGE5MzI3MzE0N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/0e21b7d4aecfc62c6ba645f80b690eb76e5aebed","sha":"0e21b7d4aecfc62c6ba645f80b690eb76e5aebed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/0e21b7d4aecfc62c6ba645f80b690eb76e5aebed"}],"sha":"c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/c92c7bc86faee8211b76675767b3d8a93273147f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/0e21b7d4aecfc62c6ba645f80b690eb76e5aebed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T21:30:34Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T21:30:34Z","email":"bradleygolden@Bradleys-Mac-mini.local","name":"Bradley Golden"},"message":"feat(ui): overhaul block-type styling with container transparency and visual hierarchy\n\n- Section/row/column blocks become transparent wrappers; their children\n  render as individual cards with proper backgrounds and borders.\n- Section headings styled as uppercase accent labels with left border.\n- Row children flex equally with consistent gap.\n- Image cards go edge-to-edge (zero padding, no inner border-radius).\n- List cards get left accent border, text/notes get gold accent.\n- Metric cards centered, scene-layout scrollable for tall content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b69ac50d9aba690b98d0a8d864ff4ab290726de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/trees/2b69ac50d9aba690b98d0a8d864ff4ab290726de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/git/commits/0e21b7d4aecfc62c6ba645f80b690eb76e5aebed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/0e21b7d4aecfc62c6ba645f80b690eb76e5aebed","node_id":"C_kwDORZxKsNoAKDBlMjFiN2Q0YWVjZmM2MmM2YmE2NDVmODBiNjkwZWI3NmU1YWViZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commit/713b3a68cab1f895a39c9d82dadf7a5affd3157a","sha":"713b3a68cab1f895a39c9d82dadf7a5affd3157a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/713b3a68cab1f895a39c9d82dadf7a5affd3157a"}],"sha":"0e21b7d4aecfc62c6ba645f80b690eb76e5aebed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/recursive-systems/clawscreen/commits/0e21b