/ focus-visible /\n  glass-surface; annotate residual px hairlines (2px outline, 1px\n  borders, sr-only).\n- global.scss: annotate the 16px root font-size as the rem anchor.\n- Token-discipline rewrites — Navbar, NavNode, Spinner, Skeleton,\n  RemoteApp module.scss now consume semantic tokens + mixins (no raw\n  colors, no raw z-index, no local \\$mobile-breakpoint).\n- px-sweep with justified-px comments on Button, Card, ThemeToggle,\n  Page module.scss.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4f7d77dc37256ec06bdc95cc1f642fe04320bc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/git/trees/a4f7d77dc37256ec06bdc95cc1f642fe04320bc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/git/commits/76106845935bd9b3e652e34a9406c1e7672bf65d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58611720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertfromsd","id":58611720,"login":"albertfromsd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjExNzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/commit/76106845935