pe guard. tsc 5.9 with strict flags rejects the\n   cast — Error doesn''t sufficiently overlap with ApiError (missing the\n   required `status` field). The guard makes it sound and reads better.\n\n2. rsbuild.config.ts: add `sassOptions.loadPaths: [SRC_DIR]` to the sass\n   plugin so every .scss file can write `@use ''shared/styles'' as *;`\n   regardless of where it lives in the tree. Drops the ../../.. chains\n   and keeps imports stable across folder moves.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c7f1deb51e1328ca9e0682334844b1c82726134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/git/trees/7c7f1deb51e1328ca9e0682334844b1c82726134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/git/commits/094250de72cf645c478f9a4d260d7de7e0807ab2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58611720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertfromsd","id":58611720,"login":"albertfromsd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjExNzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/commit/094250d