":"","html_url":"https://github.com/albertfromsd","id":58611720,"login":"albertfromsd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjExNzIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/commits/7244256856db01609e1c2d4cf19354b8a394b96a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T02:15:29Z","email":"albertfromsd@gmail.com","name":"Albert Ahn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T02:15:29Z","email":"albertfromsd@gmail.com","name":"Albert Ahn"},"message":"add design system, portable components; drop tailwind\n\nAdopt the live host''s design tokens, mixins, breakpoints, typography\nscale, and theme.config so the template matches what every portfolio\napp already uses. Wire global.scss into App.tsx.\n\nAdd Button, Card, Page, ThemeToggle to src/components and re-export the\npublic-facing ones (Button, Card, ThemeToggle, Spinner, Skeleton) from\nthe components barrel. ThemeToggle imports from ''@/stores/session'' so\nthe template stays self-contained instead of depending on a federated\nhost name.\n\nRemove @tailwindcss/postcss + tailwindcss devDeps and delete\npostcss.config.mjs — neither was used by the live host and the tokens\nmake them redundant. Strip the @import ''tailwindcss'' line and inline\nbody resets from App.css; global.scss now handles those via tokens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f315a75e1830ea4ce177a7760f297dd99d6504b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/git/trees/f315a75e