 host: routes, remote mount, mobile navbar\n\n- configure rsbuild entry to src/main.tsx so the bootstrap async-import\n  pattern is actually used; flip shared modules to eager: false (the\n  standard MF pattern — eager + async bootstrap was throwing\n  \"factory is undefined\" on consume/default/react)\n- add Routes.tsx defining real routes; lazy-load remoteTemplate/App at\n  /remote/* behind Suspense + ErrorBoundary so a remote outage cannot\n  take down the shell\n- add remotes.d.ts declaring the federated remoteTemplate/App module\n  for TypeScript\n- rebuild Navbar as a fixed top horizontal bar with a hamburger drawer\n  at <=768px (auto-closes on route change via useLocation)\n- rewire NavNode to react-router-dom NavLink with active-state styling;\n  submenus open on hover (desktop) / click (mobile, stacked)\n- App.tsx becomes the shell (Navbar + main containing AppRoutes);\n  App.css reserves --navbar-height under the fixed bar\n- remove dead src/index.tsx (rsbuild''s default entry, now superseded)\n- fix bootstrap.tsx style import (was pointing at broken @styles alias)\n- tsconfig: restore @/* path alias (drops baseUrl since paths now\n  resolve relative to tsconfig directory)\n- add package.json repository field","tree":{"sha":"cba1610bb6e33e8833e66ad12706b62544075cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/git/trees/cba1610bb6e33e8833e66ad12706b62544075cab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/albertfromsd/afsd.host-mfe/git/commits/d0f2192b2644c4f34d525224a5bcfc1a22b3c4d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58611720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/albertfromsd/