Z","email":"quentin.alamelou@gmail.com","name":"kiukairor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T09:01:01Z","email":"quentin.alamelou@gmail.com","name":"kiukairor"},"message":"feat(demo2-agent): fire NR deployment markers after every git push\n\nAdds a reusable NR Deployment Marker Helper section with:\n- changeTrackingCreateDeployment curl template using env vars from\n  ~/.config/pulse-sre/env (NEW_RELIC_USER_API_KEY + NR_ENTITY_GUID_*)\n- entity GUID mapping table per bug pattern (BUG_AI_SLOW fires both\n  NR_ENTITY_GUID_AI_SVC + NR_ENTITY_GUID_PULSE_AI_DONTASK, etc.)\n- logs deploymentId on success, full response on failure\n\nCalls the helper after every git push:\n- Step 5 (revert): \"sre-agent: revert <SHA> — <PATTERN> disabled (fast recovery)\"\n- Step 6 (proper fix): \"sre-agent: fix committed — <PATTERN> removed from source\"\n- Step 4b-iii (direct fix): \"sre-agent: direct fix — <PATTERN> removed (no culprit commit)\"\n\nProduces a visible vertical line in NR charts for each remediation action,\ndistinct from the bug-injection marker already fired by the trigger script.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9569d220dccc10714fd6e26b40688bceab2e2e5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/trees/9569d220dccc10714fd6e26b40688bceab2e2e5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/commits/d7a37961d5086167c16d8f6344c287389ec458a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42732651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiukairor","id":42732651,"login":"k