pi.github.com/users/kiukairor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/commits/c66b68038644f1939865ce578b3fc1c49512660d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T08:52:20Z","email":"quentin.alamelou@gmail.com","name":"kiukairor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T08:52:20Z","email":"quentin.alamelou@gmail.com","name":"kiukairor"},"message":"feat(demo2-agent): richer investigation output and RCA block\n\n- Step 3e: mandatory NR Evidence Summary block written to log via bash\n  echo after all NRQL queries (p95 peak, avg, slowest tx, error rate,\n  NR marker SHA+time)\n- Step 4b (new): mandatory Root Cause Analysis block written to log\n  after bad commit diff is read — explains mechanism, affected files,\n  user impact, and change value (not just pattern name)\n- Step 7: expanded final summary to include timeline (bad commit →\n  marker → alert → revert), root cause sentence, NR signal summary,\n  and kubectl verify-recovery commands\n- All three summary templates now use bash echo so output lands in the\n  log in real time, not only at agent exit\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf1c2f639cc94912afd994b94a4804ec08b16a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/trees/cf1c2f639cc94912afd994b94a4804ec08b16a05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/commits/c66b68038644f1939865ce578b3fc1c49512660d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42732651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiukairor","