 treats the runbook as instructions\n  rather than content to summarise; -p now carries only the execution\n  trigger\n- DEMO2_AGENT.md: add Step 4b-iii (direct code fix when no culprit\n  commit found but bug pattern detected in live source); add Step 4b-iv\n  (no-fix diagnosis when code scan finds nothing); add third Step 7\n  summary variant for the direct-fix path; update Hard-Stop Rules\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0108f8ce69d5d0ec148061e9ec809e6aaf3ed2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/trees/b0108f8ce69d5d0ec148061e9ec809e6aaf3ed2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/commits/d32468941c1d44bc5099eb278f6b51c3378826e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42732651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiukairor","id":42732651,"login":"kiukairor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNzMyNjUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kiukairor/bigdem/commit/d32468941c1d44bc5099eb278f6b51c3378826e6","node_id":"C_kwDORZ92INoAKGQzMjQ2ODk0MWMxZDQ0YmM1MDk5ZWIyNzhmNmI1MWMzMzc4ODI2ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https: