vious agent runs — should not exist in clean state).\n\ndemos/sources/ai-svc-main-bug-ai-slow.py: add the BUG_AI_SLOW-gated\ntime.sleep(8) that was missing (bug source had no sleep — backwards from\nwhat the demo needs; sync handler so blocking sleep is fine).\n\ndemos/sources/pulse-ai-dontask-main-bug-ai-slow.py: time.sleep(8) →\nawait asyncio.sleep(8) + add asyncio import. Async handler — blocking\nsleep was clogging the event loop, causing health check timeouts and\nCrashLoopBackOff under locust load.\n\ndemos/DEMO.md: split bug commit push from boundary-update push. GitHub\nskips CI when HEAD commit has [skip ci] — bundling both commits meant the\nbug image was never built. Now: push bug commit first (CI fires), then\npush boundary update separately (CI correctly skips).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"396c3cdd95def388a59b521125fc25c821b693a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/trees/396c3cdd95def388a59b521125fc25c821b693a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/commits/437ea24f68d872cbd2f5da62d12fbde6f868d418","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42732651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiukairor","id":42732651,"login":"kiukairor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNzMyNjUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/starr