ttps://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/commits/85c637cc0bfa46d53986c5c43187520a1d6fca8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:23:43Z","email":"quentin.alamelou@gmail.com","name":"kiukairor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T14:23:43Z","email":"quentin.alamelou@gmail.com","name":"kiukairor"},"message":"fix: set SRE boundary to pre-bug commit so agent can revert bug SHA [skip ci]\n\nBoundary was set to the bug commit SHA itself (98b2e188), which is ambiguous —\nan agent reading \"never revert commits older than X\" might treat X as off-limits.\nSet boundary to the parent commit (079f804, the clean pre-bug state) so the bug\ncommit (98b2e188) is unambiguously newer and safe to revert.\n\nAlso fix demos/DEMO.md trigger to use HEAD^ (parent) instead of HEAD when\ncomputing the boundary SHA, so future demo runs are correct by default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e72904ec60d59ad5e7183084b36f713f2e573446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/trees/e72904ec60d59ad5e7183084b36f713f2e573446"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kiukairor/bigdem/git/commits/85c637cc0bfa46d53986c5c43187520a1d6fca8a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42732651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiukairor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kiukairor","id":42732651,"