sers/douglasAltia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/douglasAltia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/b5eedff5ee65f50621912f71a98d2a227dd1d5a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:47:00Z","email":"d.martinez.loor@altia.es","name":"douglasAltia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:47:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add LoginSessionService to handle login abort scenarios (#104)\n\n* Add LoginSessionService to handle login abort scenarios\n\nImplements the `LoginSessionService` with functionality to handle the `abort` flow for pending logins. Integrates the service into the login timeout redirection process in `login.component.ts`. Updates existing tests and adds new ones to validate the end-to-end behavior, ensuring proper handling for redirect scenarios and fallback cases. Also removes `ISSUER_HOME_PATH` and modifies the redirection logic and tests accordingly.\n\n* Handle clipboard unavailability in login component\n\n* resolve conflicts\n\n* Ensure late login completions override timeout aborts\n\nKeeps the SSE stream open longer to allow login completions received near the timeout to redirect successfully instead of showing a session expired error. Updates tests to cover race conditions and late completion scenarios.","tree":{"sha":"46e7e61c46d9c5a76c9d1651a1969a40c1215953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/46e7e61c46d9c5a76c9d1651a1969a40c1215953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/b5eedff5ee65f50621912f71a98d2a227dd1d5a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 46e7e61c46d9c5a76c9d1651a1969a40c1215953\nparent 22c950be7b61f5c33879e27b87ca110df20dc784\nauthor douglasAltia <d.martinez.loor@altia.es> 1791449220 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791449220 +0200\n\nAdd LoginSessionService to handle login abort scenarios (#104)\n\n* Add LoginSessionService to handle login abort scenarios\n\nImplements the `LoginSessionService` with functionality to handle the `abort` flow for pending logins. Integrates the service into the login timeout redirection process in `login.component.ts`. Updates existing tests and adds new ones to validate the end-to-end behavior, ensuring proper handling for redirect scenarios and fallback cases. Also removes `ISSUER_HOME_PATH` and modifies the redirection logic and tests accordingly.\n\n* Handle clipboard unavailability in login component\n\n* resolve conflicts\n\n* Ensure late login completions override timeout aborts\n\nKeeps the SSE stream open longer to allow login completions received near the timeout to redirect successfully instead of showing a session expired error. Updates tests to cover race conditions and late completion scenarios.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx1iECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbv4QAKvJbb30Xuiw5ug5PFDjE59P\naV6oEViZNiWzGwst156AbbKngszc7/YIkVdTkQcOvE1ATGfi5CBeWxT3s1uiwOmD\nMgpG4j/kGA1NwF0dNp7qXSoImHmXga3rgEHkmKQoo86GGfiQTDbY1S9Hg7s4bbZ3\neHMyZQVBXcKRzfTFScZ+XemcWEzKUjywn4SyUEOCroDu0yl2EmizFJhEvBuhkbZN\nXVtZewBhb08O8BH8KQZtXI31Ks6FQPd6wiYzRJdZZC8u/f1oGhwJoVusronhLxfK\ndKMqbHm9x2oJp8ttF+Ndifq6tfq1nP46BQGwcJCrj/+R5wYuK2V8pdYgXa8tHuda\nNWoYcm7aCDww/h0lcjiWFJwU72KYInB5yiMdnAGhd33qSPvJv0L0+6/LAtgxlxV4\nYqYSJnQsdM3X3JfaiUspi6IvKLlOYBAQFcVLDoPSCeCHjBDvbslrD0CuF8UsrHxO\nAaBxC3ZmxoSi/VE+CeOj2V4eGAY46vuOQ/xsGYlslIefoguTE3qrFMgrQw8HY/1f\nxtIy7Lgnl495R3CnL78DGD6aAgo3uv+tr6h/4y+jb6UrvRDtlzqKwWyKzHAuGfc/\nwC613HrVNFqQTzFUqWH5yFLsd3WuBGirSHsd+tyKINiHZp2hCQ+uzNw7XmLnpUe8\nEEm1yOpgXzwYITpqqZcs\n=xz49\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:47:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followe