_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriolcanades","id":83498869,"login":"oriolcanades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDk4ODY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/c564057917ba4d16e82dfadbe14ef9b47e9211e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:54:26Z","email":"oriol.canades@altia.es","name":"Oriol Canadés"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:54:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): ignore eslint majors until the Angular 19 -> 21 migration (#76)\n\neslint 10 support first lands in angular-eslint 21, which declares a hard\npeer on @angular/cli >= 21.0.0 < 22.0.0. This repo is on Angular 19, so\nangular-eslint 19.8.1 caps eslint at ^8.57.0 || ^9.0.0 and `npm ci` fails\nwith ERESOLVE on any eslint 10 bump (PR #30).\n\nIgnoring the major keeps dependabot from reopening an unmergeable PR every\nweek. The entry must be removed as part of the Angular 19 -> 21 migration,\nwhich also needs angular-eslint bumped 19 -> 21 by hand (dependabot does\nnot propose it).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9db073a3643ae5fa760d6eb24b5dea613d1976e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/f9db073a3643ae5fa760d6eb24b5dea613d1976e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repo