vAOLLSmNzqN5okTybA1b1i0Us3w\nn5Fr+ZoTtSjILnlm2wwz\n=TOxc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-28T08:27:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commit/1d397869eb08a10b7ab96364f1ed94f844301b70","node_id":"C_kwDORZ98G9oAKDFkMzk3ODY5ZWIwOGExMGI3YWI5NjM2NGYxZWQ5NGY4NDQzMDFiNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commit/2bdef1218cc65246f5baa24f452125da02d2c7ac","sha":"2bdef1218cc65246f5baa24f452125da02d2c7ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/2bdef1218cc65246f5baa24f452125da02d2c7ac"}],"sha":"1d397869eb08a10b7ab96364f1ed94f844301b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/1d397869eb08a10b7ab96364f1ed94f844301b70"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83498869?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriolcanades","id":83498869,"login":"oriolcanades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDk4ODY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/2bdef1218cc65246f5baa24f452125da02d2c7ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:12:05Z","email":"oriol.canades@altia.es","name":"Oriol Canadés"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:12:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(EUD-38): add the SBOM inventory and the license gate (#74)\n\n* ci(EUD-38): add the SBOM inventory and the license gate\n\nThis repository ships a distributable artifact and had no licence\nverification: it generated an inventory but nothing checked it, and the\ngenerator was fetched at build time with npx --yes.\n\n- Vendor the gate (evaluator, its node --test suite, policy, exception\n  register, workflow, CODEOWNERS) so the repository verifies itself without\n  depending on any other one.\n- Pin @cyclonedx/cyclonedx-npm as an exact devDependency and run it through\n  npm run sbom after npm ci, keeping development components marked in the\n  inventory instead of omitting them.\n- Publish the inventory as a release asset named after the version, and check\n  with --expect-version that it describes the artifact being released.\n\nThe gate passes with no exceptions registered: 33 runtime components comply.\n\nPatch bump to 3.3.7: the version lives in the same file as the change, so it is\nnot a separate commit here.\n\nStory: EUD-38\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(EUD-38): point the vendored gate suite at the evaluator next to it\n\nThe suite lives beside the evaluator once vendored (.github/scripts/), but the\ntemplate kept it in a test/ subdirectory, so the copied file imported\n''../license-gate.mjs'' and failed to load. `node --test` reported one failing\ntest with no assertion behind it, and the gate job died before generating any\ninventory.\n\nThe template now keeps both files side by side, which is the layout every\nrepository actually uses, so a literal copy works.\n\nStory: EUD-38\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4faedee54d1224b3e987b251ffd2a302a11c1182","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/4faedee54d1224b3e987b251ffd2a302a11c1182"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/2bdef1218cc65246f5baa24f452125da02d2c7ac","verification":{"payload":"tree 4faedee54d1224b3e987b251ffd2a302a11c1182\nparent 6dd24f1c06c01ce4fe4a622d03896057ab288a06\nauthor Oriol Canadés <oriol.canades@altia.es> 1787904725 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787904725 +0200\n\nci(EUD-38): add the SBOM inventory and the license gate (#74)\n\n* ci(EUD-38): add the SBOM inventory and the license gate\n\nThis repository ships a distributable artifact and had no licence\nverification: it generated an inventory but nothing checked it, and the\ngenerator was fetched at build time with npx --yes.\n\n- Vendor the gate (evaluator, its node --test suite, policy, exception\n  register, workflow, CODEOWNERS) so the repository verifies itself without\n  depending on any other one.\n- Pin @cyclonedx/cyclonedx-npm as an exact devDependency and run it through\n  npm run sbom after npm ci, keeping development components marked in the\n  inventory instead of omitting them.\n- Publish the inventory as a release asset named after the version, and check\n  with --expect-version that it describes the artifact being released.\n\nThe gate passes with no exceptions registered: 33 runtime components comply.\n\nPatch bump to 3.3.7: the version lives in the same file as the change, so it is\nnot a separate commit here.\n\nStory: EUD-38\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(EUD-38): point the vendored gate suite at the evaluator next to it\n\nThe suite lives beside the evaluator once vendored (.github/scripts/), but the\ntemplate kept it in a test/ subdirectory, so the copied file imported\n''../license-gate.mjs'' and failed to load. `node --test` reported one failing\ntest with no assertion behind it, and the gate job died before generating any\ninventory.\n\nThe template now keeps both files side by side, which is the layout every\nrepository actually uses, so a literal copy works.\n\nStory: EUD-38\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkULVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfEMQAF/DYOzMLgDgXUT05aWHwHyR\nObakq7DhXI18ZEJH8+T/hrxAyrbPrIZoU5rY/vp9YmKB+byKISORqsm8+wxjsfgD\nmB5tptPKyl+XEkZehvRt3dvPNkSNomTMcm3Bx4osgmnF4ayaJz9+nulHR7dzA37a\n1IbGj41Yr3UCZNUA8LuHDFc0J+N4gSGKuGvD5I4E/3ovddt6Y+l/f+vxzM6m4CzX\nHapYpjUk6613+dsXMNxrWEp+MooUZTyzjd5mJupWa2e3A5cGKRhmB+sNmNrA1J1W\ny4LMtbfRRtXKm3u5qLaEmtF5kxNj8h7OB6hAGln/BSsPZuCha7YNyER7muP51uWg\n+4WO0LhOxzJRWKQ4V1N2rBXXQ+UpJSH8MZQk8NKZxlKJSFjeehVBRWUHpRTjUrKw\nN/kRvlyP6nMJ62Ry6XPDU/TohuXWLmx5kMEnKoFJL4AZPdOdLy/SUZpPirq2Qkt/\n4iD2eBeImUZZ3tv7qgcLggsUDB9vPAlXgEd1HIjUrNKeHzf/BDwPIxyj5O/xglME\nVjdzJEapCx++XSCP1SYz4kFj3D+c3ybvSvhZc/7jMOYPcBw3Enk