ttps://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriolcanades","id":83498869,"login":"oriolcanades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDk4ODY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/8cf2bf5c669882232cdafc96a81c8d900f4340c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T09:20:59Z","email":"ocanades@outlook.com","name":"Oriol Canades"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T09:20:59Z","email":"ocanades@outlook.com","name":"Oriol Canades"},"message":"ci: always run CodeQL on pull requests\n\nThe `code_scanning` ruleset rule demands a CodeQL analysis for the commit\nbeing merged; it is evaluated at merge time and does not surface as a\ncheck-run. Skipping CodeQL on a docs-only PR therefore leaves the rule\nwith no results and blocks the merge with \"Code scanning is waiting for\nresults from CodeQL for the commit\" - the same deadlock this series set\nout to remove, just moved from the check list to the merge button.\n\nDrop the `changes` gate from codeql.yml so `Analyze` always runs. The\ngate stays in the build workflow, where no ruleset rule depends on it.\n\nNet effect versus the original workflow: only `paths-ignore` on the\n`pull_request` trigger is gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6daa5c3c66b99c16a5f36ebf1c5749f1cbaaf5c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/6daa5c3c66b99c16a5f36ebf1c5749f1cbaaf5c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/8cf2bf5c669882232cdafc96a81c8d900f4340c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83498869?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriolcanades","id":83498869,"login":"oriolcanades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDk4ODY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commit/8cf2bf5c669882232cdafc96a81c8d900f4340c6","node_id":"C_kwDORZ98G9oAKDhjZjJiZjVjNjY5ODgyMjMyY2RhZmM5NmE4MWM4ZDkwMGY0MzQwYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commit/575ce745777f3ea1f6f64838c5d5fadd429ca8dd","sha":"575ce745777f3ea1f6f64838c5d5fadd429ca8dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/575ce745777f3ea1f6f64838c5d5fadd429ca8dd"}],"sha":"8cf2bf5c669882232cdafc96a81c8d900f4340c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/8cf2bf5c669882232cdafc96a81c8d900f4340c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83498869?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriolcanades","id":83498869,"login":"oriolcanades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDk4ODY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/575ce745777f3ea1f6f64838c5d5fadd429ca8dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T08:59:16Z","email":"ocanades@outlook.com","name":"Oriol Canades"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T08:59:16Z","email":"ocanades@outlook.com","name":"Oriol Canades"},"message":"ci: make PR and CodeQL jobs always report so they can be required checks\n\n`paths-ignore` on the `pull_request` trigger stopped the workflow from\nrunning at all on docs-only or workflow-only PRs. Any status check from\nthose workflows then stayed at \"Expected - waiting for status to be\nreported\" forever, which is why the required checks had to be removed.\n\nReplace the trigger-level filter with a `changes` gate job\n(dorny/paths-filter, pinned, predicate-quantifier `every`) and move the\nskip to a job-level `if`. The workflow now always runs; a job skipped by\na conditional reports Success, which satisfies branch protection.\n\nFail-closed: the job is skipped only when the filter explicitly reports\nno code changes. Push/schedule events and any filter failure still run it.\n\nPath-skip semantics are unchanged: **/*.md, docs/**, .github/**, LICENSE,\n.gitignore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"222e406c321cd451927c478e41d67cd0f322dae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/222e406c321cd451927c478e41d67cd0f322dae5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/575ce745777f3ea1f6f64838c5d5fadd429ca8dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83498869?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriolcanades","id":83498869,"login":"oriolcanades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDk4ODY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commit/575ce745777f3ea1f6f64838c5d5fadd429ca8dd","node_id":"C_kwDORZ98G9oAKDU3NWNlNzQ1Nzc3ZjNlYTFmNmY2NDgzOGM1ZDVmYWRkNDI5Y2E4ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/in