s://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commit/b1facb7e5f32f4a9e6f90ce018d7543c1b9e0642","node_id":"C_kwDORZ98G9oAKGIxZmFjYjdlNWYzMmY0YTllNmY5MGNlMDE4ZDc1NDNjMWI5ZTA2NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commit/151b01271ce9d1b10a37c60236fde7bde9fa1a07","sha":"151b01271ce9d1b10a37c60236fde7bde9fa1a07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/151b01271ce9d1b10a37c60236fde7bde9fa1a07"}],"sha":"b1facb7e5f32f4a9e6f90ce018d7543c1b9e0642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/b1facb7e5f32f4a9e6f90ce018d7543c1b9e0642"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/151b01271ce9d1b10a37c60236fde7bde9fa1a07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T14:40:40Z","email":"alba.lopez@in2.es","name":"AlbaLopez552"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T14:40:40Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(login): add configurable tenant-embedded footer to LoginComponent (EUDISTACK-606) (#58)\n\n* feat(EUDISTACK-606): add configurable tenant-embedded footer to LoginComponent\n\n- ThemeService: add sanitizedFooter getter delegating to sanitizeEmbedHtml()\n  — same DOMPurify allow-list + empty-guard + bypassSecurityTrustHtml pipeline\n  as header embed (AD-1 / ADR-arch-002 / ADR-arch-003)\n- LoginComponent(TS): add footerHtml: SafeHtml | null = null property;\n  derive from theme stream in ngOnInit alongside headerHtml\n- LoginComponent(HTML): add *ngIf=\"footerHtml\" .embedded-footer container\n  at page bottom (FR-07 / AC-02 — node fully absent when null, no space\n  reserved); remove deprecated registration-card block (ADR-arch-005)\n- LoginComponent(SCSS): add .embedded-footer styles; remove dead\n  .registration-card block (deprecated with onboardingUrl)\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* test(EUDISTACK-606): extend unit tests for sanitizedFooter getter and footer conditional render\n\n- theme.service.spec.ts: add sanitizedFooter describe block (14 tests) covering\n  EC-04 (null/undefined/absent input), AC-01 (valid HTML), AC-03 (allow-list\n  preservation), EC-01 (empty after sanitize), EC-02 (mixed), EC-03 (deep\n  nesting), ES-01 (<script>), ES-02 (javascript: href), ES-03 (on* handlers),\n  ES-04 (<style>)\n- login.component.spec.ts: add embedded footer describe block (5 tests) covering\n  AC-02/EC-04 (absent when null), AC-01 (present when SafeHtml), AC-02 (node\n  removed on null transition — *ngIf not [hidden]), EC-01 (absent when\n  sanitization returns null), coexistence (header + footer both rendered)\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* docs(EUDISTACK-606): C1 — update CHANGELOG.md with US-003 footer embed entries\n\nAdded under [Unreleased]: footer embed render (FR-06/FR-07/AC-01/AC-02),\nDOMPurify sanitization pipeline (FR-08/AC-03/ES-01-ES-04), empty-after-sanitize\nguard (EC-01), DOME footerEmbedCode seed, and removal of deprecated\nregistration-card block and onboardingUrl field (ADR-arch-005).\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): eliminate gap between login card and embedded footer\n\n:host display:block → display:flex flex-direction:column so the host is\na flex container. .page min-height:calc(100vh-105px) → flex:1 so it\nfills available space without reserving a fixed height, allowing the\nembedded footer to appear immediately after the card content.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): .page auto-height so footer follows card content\n\nflex:1 on .page still filled all available space, keeping the gap.\nRemoving the constraint lets .page size to its content; :host flex-column\nwith min-height:100vh fills the background. Footer now appears right\nafter the card, as intended.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): align embedded-footer width/margins with .container\n\nmax-width:80% + margin:0 auto + padding:0 20px mirrors the .container\nconstraints so the footer spans the same horizontal area as the card.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): adjust embedded-footer margin for better centering\n\n* refactor(login): remove dead navigateOnboarding method and empty SCSS rule\n\nCleanup after code review (EUDISTACK-606): remove unreachable\nnavigateOnboarding() method and its unit test (onboardingUrl deprecated\nper ADR-arch-005), and drop the empty .page{} SCSS rule.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 3.3.0\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bcfd89f6260313d80e71f25703461ed37bdf6f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/bcfd89f6260313d80e71f25703461ed37bdf6f6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/151b01271ce9d1b10a37c60236fde7bde9fa1a07","verification":{"payload":"tree bcfd89f6260313d80e71f25703461ed37bdf6f6d\nparent 6ea98c044cfd2e5e7b266749d4608c31c719f03b\nauthor AlbaLopez552 <alba.lopez@in2.es> 1781707240 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781707240 +0200\n\nfeat(login): add configurable tenant-embedded footer to LoginComponent (EUDISTACK-606) (#58)\n\n* feat(EUDISTACK-606): add configurable tenant-embedded footer to LoginComponent\n\n- ThemeService: add sanitizedFooter getter delegating to sanitizeEmbedHtml()\n  — same DOMPurify allow-list + empty-guard + bypassSecurityTrustHtml pipeline\n  as header embed (AD-1 / ADR-arch-002 / ADR-arch-003)\n- LoginComponent(TS): add footerHtml: SafeHtml | null = null property;\n  derive from theme stream in ngOnInit alongside headerHtml\n- LoginComponent(HTML): add *ngIf=\"footerHtml\" .embedded-footer container\n  at page bottom (FR-07 / AC-02 — node fully absent when null, no space\n  reserved); remove deprecated registration-card block (ADR-arch-005)\n- LoginComponent(SCSS): add .embedded-footer styles; remove dead\n  .registration-card block (deprecated with onboardingUrl)\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* test(EUDISTACK-606): extend unit tests for sanitizedFooter getter and footer conditional render\n\n- theme.service.spec.ts: add sanitizedFooter describe block (14 tests) covering\n  EC-04 (null/undefined/absent input), AC-01 (valid HTML), AC-03 (allow-list\n  preservation), EC-01 (empty after sanitize), EC-02 (mixed), EC-03 (deep\n  nesting), ES-01 (<script>), ES-02 (javascript: href), ES-03 (on* handlers),\n  ES-04 (<style>)\n- login.component.spec.ts: add embedded footer describe block (5 tests) covering\n  AC-02/EC-04 (absent when null), AC-01 (present when SafeHtml), AC-02 (node\n  removed on null transition — *ngIf not [hidden]), EC-01 (absent when\n  sanitization returns null), coexistence (header + footer both rendered)\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* docs(EUDISTACK-606): C1 — update CHANGELOG.md with US-003 footer embed entries\n\nAdded under [Unreleased]: footer embed render (FR-06/FR-07/AC-01/AC-02),\nDOMPurify sanitization pipeline (FR-08/AC-03/ES-01-ES-04), empty-after-sanitize\nguard (EC-01), DOME footerEmbedCode seed, and removal of deprecated\nregistration-card block and onboardingUrl field (ADR-arch-005).\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): eliminate gap between login card and embedded footer\n\n:host display:block → display:flex flex-direction:column so the host is\na flex container. .page min-height:calc(100vh-105px) → flex:1 so it\nfills available space without reserving a fixed height, allowing the\nembedded footer to appear immediately after the card content.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): .page auto-height so footer follows card content\n\nflex:1 on .page still filled all available space, keeping the gap.\nRemoving the constraint lets .page size to its content; :host flex-column\nwith min-height:100vh fills the background. Footer now appears right\nafter the card, as intended.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): align embedded-footer width/margins with .container\n\nmax-width:80% + margin:0 auto + padding:0 20px mirrors the .container\nconstraints so the footer spans the same horizontal area as the card.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\n\n* fix(EUDISTACK-606): adjust embedded-footer margin for better centering\n\n* refactor(login): remove dead navigateOnboarding method and empty SCSS rule\n\nCleanup after code review (EUDISTACK-606): remove unreachable\nnavigateOnboarding() method and its unit test (onboardingUrl deprecated\nper ADR-arch-005), and drop the empty .page{} SCSS rule.\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 3.3.0\n\nStory: EUDISTACK-606\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMrHoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGYQQAHmlGAQWC7TfNHYhzbcamibp\n8MSlUsOGx3QFvPE1QjEjVA+6uKd1QPe9hHwskPLOuRPPtYwyTffBfEqas308cwoW\nEmxfQGZy/qJ+EREYDxz54/estkfd07Q+XP2b2/qOSd1ubwPPk90BYPPGQrCd6BEL\nxHBSprUXQGoP+6L5s8oTkoP/bGe5xAuOmxuVoyw7vWiCqE3aLz7SaQOT2M0UecX1\nzCD88+67ZF8w8f/sjPD7MyTQGL4PU6HA1cN58AXOf+SKlSwv6JXEBMBF7mpaQQbV\nqKBbbIU6u21w/MerUV7shwIGSTy2S2u5PoiRWF0v2jxkneR8FdMXdyzBShYBKhHu\ncWySttncroCx8uAQHA3Rcqa4zHEXjlzSQuOMgrICMGte32nXnYyKct9Oovs284cg\naF5h6lDgL2gZKaEQ+TQoX4SNvO2hwzxJ6XKrEx9vUzTZELFl+nlKVIaqyn7R++8D\novCsTk8djhZA/23YPPKxStcMQKvYrI+GLuDmcXXsmgH4jXGreeudC1JhbqHD0nVb\n5ixEu2YqZMXEFq+bf61XVP5h4pnFGrypMPG5HLveE7V495gYYfJXVby79GwFfElX\n31izXnsseu1UDrEUNVkHhFfcXS8OfIZi7CvOGMFNpvbVdeKuxB5f7eJC9WyxiXBM\ngBgU44ZwvoufPNcUo9ds\n=44Hv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-17T14:40:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}",