tia.es","name":"rogermiretin2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T10:05:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/tenant resolution (#55)\n\n* feat: custom-domain.json fallback for tenant resolution\n\n  APP_INITIALIZER now chains tenantService.resolve() → themeService.load()\n  in a single factory, guaranteeing the signal is settled before ThemeService\n  reads it.\n\n  tenants.constants.ts is reduced to data-only (KNOWN_TENANTS, FALLBACK_TENANT);\n  all resolution logic moves into TenantService as private members.\n  ThemeService reads this.tenantService.tenant() instead of calling\n  resolveTenant(window.location.hostname) directly.\n\n* core(version): upgrade version and add changelog entry\n\n* feat: point to `assets/tenants/custom-domain.json` instead of `assets/custom-domain.json`\n\n* test: fix tenant service test","tree":{"sha":"da694d5afc75995949e4db4a665aaf91f0e991af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/da694d5afc75995949e4db4a665aaf91f0e991af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/91395898471f7474e71aa8e8d794910cca315b55","verification":{"payload":"tree da694d5afc75995949e4db4a665aaf91f0e991af\nparent 42dd632b079f394de8d7ce335dd21705290fb2d4\nauthor rogermiretin2 <roger.miret@altia.es> 1781517914 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781517914 +0200\n\nFeat/tenant resolution (#55)\n\n* feat: custom-domain.json fallback for tenant resolution\n\n  APP_INITIALIZER now chains tenantService.resolve() → themeService.load()\n  in a single factory, guaranteeing the signal is settled before ThemeService\n  reads it.\n\n  tenants.constants.ts is reduced to data-only (KNOWN_TENANTS, FALLBACK_TENANT);\n  all resolution logic moves into TenantService as private members.\n  ThemeService reads this.tenantService.tenant() instead of calling\n  resolveTenant(window.location.hostname) directly.\n\n* core(version): upgrade version and add 