eme.service spec paths to relative\n\nMatch ThemeService relative path (''assets/theme.json'' not ''/assets/...'').\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: swap EUDIStack logo light/dark variants\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore(EUDI-064): close SaaS multi-tenant feature — v3.1.0\n\nShips MFE Login v3.1.0 with product branding baked at build time,\nAtlassian-style base-href, and relative API URLs for same-origin routing\n(EUDI-064).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Oriol Canadés <83498869+oriolcanadesin2@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3c01b8791d2a242de8fa42ff209e6c091e7d8c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/d3c01b8791d2a242de8fa42ff209e6c091e7d8c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/3a2f6ef39dd426d8985f28150b68ed555d71e156","verification":{"payload":"tree d3c01b8791d2a242de8fa42ff209e6c091e7d8c4\nparent adbbdc61e652a514935d01311d74297fe15056c8\nauthor Oriol Canadés <oriol.canades@altia.es> 1776760195 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776760195 +0200\n\nfeat(EUDI-064): MFE Login product branding + Atlassian-style — v3.1.0 (#42)\n\n* feat(EUDI-064): Atlassian-style relative URL in env.template.js\n\n- api_base_url: relative path /verifier (same origin, no CORS)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(EUDI-064): use relative path for theme.json (base-href compatible)\n\nChanged ''/assets/theme.json'' to ''assets/theme.json'' (without leading /).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat(EUDI-064): bake EUDIStack product branding in build\n\nAdded EUDIStack product logos and theme.json with relative asset paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 