026-03-24T12:24:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: normalize version and CHANGELOG for v3.0.0 (#24)\n\n* chore: normalize version to v3.0.0 and consolidate CHANGELOG for release\n\n- Fix package.json version from 3.0.1 to 3.0.0\n- Merge [3.0.1] and [Unreleased] sections into [3.0.0] - 2026-03-24\n- Leave [Unreleased] section empty for future changes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: new CI/CD strategy — atomic release, deploy with smoke test\n\n- Replace build.yml with ci.yml (PR-only, concurrency, coverage)\n- Release triggers on push to main (idempotent, skips if exists)\n- Deploy is manual with environment selector and smoke test\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): correct coverage output paths for Jest\n\nJest writes coverage to coverage/app/ (per jest.config.js coverageDirectory),\nbut CI expected it at coverage/. Also fix jest -ci → jest --ci flag syntax.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Oriol Canadés <83498869+oriolcanadesin2@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"791765d302809613cfcbbf2d1957666e7b91e771","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/791765d302809613cfcbbf2d1957666e7b91e771"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/237c481720b57cdd26f5aba60f0b62193e22f7ae","verification":{"payload":"tree 791765d302809613cfcbbf2d1957666e7b91e771\nparent 27479ae802b23ecc04a61a25ef155a32cbc45beb\nauthor Oriol Canadés <oriol.canades@altia.es> 1774355054 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774355054 +0100\n\nchore: normalize version and CHANGELOG for v3.0.0 (#24)\n\n* chore: normalize version to v3.0.0 and consolidate CHANGELOG for release\n\n- Fix package.json version from 3.0.1 to 3.0.0\n- Merge [3.0.1] and [Unreleased] secti