url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/oriolcanades","id":83498869,"login":"oriolcanades","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDk4ODY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oriolcanades","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/commits/5579839271dbcdd86853aeeb1e9eb02b582ed48a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T23:37:29Z","email":"oriol.canades@altia.es","name":"Oriol Canadés"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T23:37:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Foundations (#1)\n\n* chore: remove shared claude submodule\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: apply ubiquitous language naming to theme and login components\n\nRename getTheme() to observeTheme() to align with domain conventions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: unify CSS variable naming — remove redundant --brand-* aliases\n\nReplace all --brand-primary/--brand-secondary variables with the single\nconvention --primary-color/--secondary-color across theme service and SCSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: premium login UX — QR pulse, countdown timer, success animation, skeleton loader\n\nAdd pulse animation on QR frame, circular SVG countdown timer, success\ncheckmark animation on VP verification, copy button bounce feedback,\nCSS skeleton loader during theme load, and error page entrance animation.\nAll animations respect prefers-reduced-motion. Add 7 new unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf: replace altia-favicon.ico (1.4MB) with optimized PNG (4KB)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: rename package to eudistack-mfe-login, migrate to eslint flat config\n\n- Rename package and bump version to 3.0.0\n- Migrate from .eslintrc.json to eslint.config.js (flat config)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add CI/CD pipelines and test coverage configuration\n\nAdd GitHub Actions workflows (build, release, deploy-aws), configure\nJest coverage reporting, and add test:ci/test:coverage npm scripts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Oriol Canadés <83498869+oriolcanadesin2@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6176802efadbd52381f5317e32e0bf6314399f02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/trees/6176802efadbd52381f5317e32e0bf6314399f02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/in2workspace/eudistack-mfe-login/git/commits/5579839271dbcdd86853aeeb1e9eb02b582ed48a","verification":{"payload":"tree 6176802efadbd52381f5317e32e0bf6314399f02\nparent 70b378598a12649d2f097ee200cbea609dc33b83\nauthor Oriol Canadés <oriol.canades@altia.es> 1773272249 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1773272249 +0100\n\nFoundations (#1)\n\n* chore: remove shared claude submodule\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: apply ubiquitous language naming to theme and login components\n\nRename getTheme() to observeTheme() to align with domain conventions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: unify CSS variable naming — remove redundant --brand-* aliases\n\nReplace all --brand-primary/--brand-secondary variables with the single\nconvention --primary-color/--secondary-color across theme service and SCSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: premium login UX — QR pulse, countdown timer, success animation, skeleton loader\n\nAdd pulse animation on QR frame, circular SVG countdown timer, success\ncheckmark animation on VP verification, copy button bounce feedback,\nCSS skeleton loader during theme load, and error page entrance animation.\nAll animations respect prefers-reduced-motion. Add 7 new unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* perf: replace altia-favicon.ico (1.4MB) with optimized PNG (4KB)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: rename package to eudistack-mfe-login, migrate to eslint flat config\n\n- Rename package and bump version to 3.0.0\n- Migrate from .eslintrc.json to eslint.config.js (flat config)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* feat: add CI/CD pipelines and test coverage configuration\n\nAdd GitHub Actions workflows (build, release, deploy-aws), configure\nJest coverage reporting, and add test:ci/test:coverage npm scripts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Oriol Canadés <83498869+oriolcanadesin2@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpsfy5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA6AQACjEYlH2GAWlxTnIri3wXPH3\nCVpWoBtV90FbDuaPabqDwGod6xodRgWEus+5QaGrPvUN4qaEMYm70H83IdXtfFDo\nWEebrUCg2XzEhrguL4W72L0uH1eM/89s5XxtTVzztfZR3vSaa5TIw//drsakLawS\nNZqu6usCdwo/3KV3neDbmYEEkB7tAUwloaSWGV4tWcjiCsM0cKE2vmeN2qNjshit\nlBwvIen4AK+jP+5d2xMyiMeDevxa0VcLoM7IUFTgpfvO4sjldnZ5oWHMxC0Hrh9q\n26XkC6nYhB2q8GISl/0UeCpbOpuAGZU9GgJrNECH7ICMyzIFfmHprb5cyIkOftrw\nWKJGktRC8D/XsilpwLKQJ3qPLdhBcsHFmm+uRgFrptM4HTiGx7KbFxamUgrDLrhe\nwvkwD5Co6zjFYIfjXjw2vw2FxElrDCUv9Siq8ZJjJ5SawJY+e/wPoHaqB1BnXUgT\nk8O9Xar3rpon80Z6uRdn5fFWhI8B