,"id":260568759,"login":"jk1224-23","node_id":"U_kgDOD4f2tw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jk1224-23/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jk1224-23/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jk1224-23/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jk1224-23/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jk1224-23/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jk1224-23","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jk1224-23/js-reference-architecture/commits/0f3c8dc6cbe85cc53d4f38d598a50770adb78624/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-02T18:50:11Z","email":"jk1224-23@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-02T18:50:11Z","email":"jk1224-23@users.noreply.github.com","name":"jk"},"message":"Add security, identity, MFE, AI context, and growth path docs\n\nNew docs:\n- 44-secret-management: full lifecycle from dev .env.local through\n  K8s/AKS, CyberArk Conjur, Azure Key Vault Workload Identity,\n  volume mount vs env var rotation, JS-specific failure modes\n- 45-sso-attributes-and-claims: OIDC claims extraction at BFF,\n  normalization across Okta/Azure AD/Keycloak/PingOne, trusted\n  context propagation to APIs, local Keycloak dev setup\n- 46-why-js-needs-this: JS-specific failure modes for sessions,\n  secrets, SSO, MFE auth, AI integration, and app growth — the\n  why-before-how discovery framing\n- 47-microfrontend-auth: shell owns session, BroadcastChannel for\n  cross-tab logout, Web Locks for refresh race prevention, MFE\n  boundary contract\n- 48-ai-session-context: authenticated user identity thread into\n  AI calls, per-user rate limiting, token usage tracking, audit\n  log shape, prompt redaction rules\n- 49-growth-path: one format four stages (working to enterprise),\n  what breaks at each stage, what to add before moving on, what\n  JS teams most commonly