9e04e73535aee471da1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T17:06:44Z","email":"saidmurad50@gmail.com","name":"saidmurad"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T17:06:44Z","email":"saidmurad50@gmail.com","name":"saidmurad"},"message":"fix(dashboard): guard against null analysis dates in turn-around metrics\n\n  GET /rest/home-dashboard/metrics threw a 500 when a finalized analysis\n  released today had a null started_date: the turn-around calculations\n  called getStartedDate()/getReleasedDate()/getCompletedDate().toLocalDate()\n  with no null check, so one bad row aborted the request and left every card\n  blank.\n\n  Skip analyses missing a required date in the four affected methods so the\n  averages and delayed count are computed over valid rows instead of throwing.\n  Read-side hardening only; the analyzer creation-path bug is tracked separately.","tree":{"sha":"9470a0831e8beea83e4356c2808efa31ffd69b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-openelis-global-2/git/trees/9470a0831e8beea83e4356c2808efa31ffd69b3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/palladium-group/ethiopiaemr-openelis-global-2/git/commits/3aa15c008bd63bb203749e04e73535aee471da1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66509482?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saidmurad/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saidmurad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saidmurad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saidmurad/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/saidmurad","id":66509482,"login":"saidmurad","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTA5NDgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saidmurad/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saidmurad/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/user