"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woofdogtw/sylvia-iot-mfe-examples/commits/deb95bed7f08cf2ec1edba652f36019f92f0107d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T08:24:22Z","email":"woofdogtw@hotmail.com","name":"Chien-Hong Chan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T10:46:34Z","email":"woofdogtw@hotmail.com","name":"Chien-Hong Chan"},"message":"Initial commit: lora-ifroglab and app-demo MFE plugins\n\nAdd two MFE plugin examples for the sylvia-iot-gui shell:\n\n- lora-ifroglab: Vue 3 + Quasar v2 + Vite\n  - Tabbed data viewer (UL Data, DL Data, Queue)\n  - Quasar components locally registered (not relying on global registration)\n  - Reactive i18n via sylvia-locale-change event (en-US / zh-TW)\n\n- app-demo: React 18 + MUI + ECharts + Vite\n  - Dashboard with ECharts gauges (temperature, humidity, pressure, RSSI)\n  - UL Data and DL Data tables with send dialog\n  - i18n via useLocale hook (en-US / zh-TW)\n\nBoth plugins communicate with the shell through window.sylviaShell.httpClient\nand respond to locale switching via the sylvia-locale-change CustomEvent.\n\nAlso includes:\n- GitHub Actions release workflow (tag → tar.xz + SBOM + SHA256SUMS)\n- OpenSpec change artifacts (archived)\n- MIT License, README","tree":{"sha":"eb2a9b41c6cd9cb1133fb1cc8940eb061605df30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woofdogtw/sylvia-iot-mfe-examples/git/trees/eb2a9b41c6cd9cb1133fb1cc8940eb061605df30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/woofdogtw/sylvia-iot-mfe-examples/git/commits/deb95bed7f08cf2ec1edba652f36019f92f0107d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46677490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woofdogtw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woofdogtw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woofdogtw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com