026-03-04T09:20:32Z","email":"raagaajava@yahoo.com","name":"Rajkumar Ganesan"},"message":"feat: adapt admin app to real backend API contract with robust auth\n\n- Adopt user-service API contract: /user-service prefix on all endpoints,\n  paginated response (data.data[] + data.pagination{}), User entity with\n  phone/createdBy/modifiedBy/tenantId fields, server-side search/sort\n- Rewrite auth token management: replace configureClient-with-headers\n  approach with setAuthToken() direct storage + request interceptor for\n  dynamic token injection — fixes 401 on page refresh\n- Add proactive token refresh (30s interval, 70s min validity),\n  onTokenExpired event handler, and 401 retry interceptor with\n  setTokenRefresher()\n- Make data-fetching hooks auth-aware: useUserList only fetches when\n  useAuth().token is available, preventing API calls before PKCE completes\n- Update Socket.IO to listen for single \"data-changed\" event (was three\n  separate entity.created/updated/deleted events)\n- Add onKeyDown/onBlur props to TextField component\n- Add getToken() async method to AuthContext for on-demand token refresh\n- Update README.md and DEVELOPMENT.md with complete authentication\n  architecture, API contract, token flow diagrams, and troubleshooting\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"d359d46058fbe15354742da0affad9ae3f4bf761","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/trees/d359d46058fbe15354742da0affad9ae3f4bf761"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/commits/d92a60bc83a6d42461c666402a9ffb32cdf7da56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commit/d92a60bc83a6d42461c666402a9ffb32cdf7da56","node_id":"C_kwDORaPS0toAKGQ5MmE2MGJjODNhNmQ0MjQ2MWM2NjY0MDJhOWZmYjMyY2RmN2RhNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commit/1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd","sha":"1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd"}],"sha":"d92a60bc83a6d42461c666402a9ffb32cdf7da56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/d92a60bc83a6d42461c666402a9ffb32cdf7da56"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T12:32:56Z","email":"raagaajava@yahoo.com","name":"Rajkumar Ganesan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T12:32:56Z","email":"raagaajava@yahoo.com","name":"Rajkumar Ganesan"},"message":"feat: wire admin app to real backend with auth, real-time sync, and Socket.IO integration\n\n- Add Keycloak PKCE authentication to admin app via AuthProvider\n- Update User entity to match backend contract (name, isActive, modifiedAt)\n- Add paginated list support (PaginatedResult with items + meta)\n- Replace dummy /admin/users endpoints with real /users API paths\n- Wire configureClient with Bearer token on Keycloak onToken callback\n- Add RealtimeProvider with real auth token for Socket.IO connections\n- Implement full CRUD UserManagement page (create/edit/delete with confirmation)\n- Add real-time sync indicator (Live/Offline) to User Management\n- Display authenticated user name and working logout in AdminLayout\n- Add VITE_USER_SERVICE_URL environment variable for direct user-service access\n- Add Socket.IO real-time module (RealtimeProvider, useRealtimeSync, socketManager) to uifunctions\n- Integrate useRealtimeSync into contacts, freight, and books module list hooks\n- Update README.md and DEVELOPMENT.md with backend integration, auth setup, and troubleshooting\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"8dc4866dc92e24b34f1d16fdb5787addfc8dcf7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/trees/8dc4866dc92e24b34f1d16fdb5787addfc8dcf7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/commits/1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commit/1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd","node_id":"C_kwDORaPS0toAKDFkMGM3MzY1MzNjOTJkZDAwZTgxMDg1OTcwNDhlNmM0MmE0NDVlZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commit/8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160","sha":"8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160"}],"sha":"1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/1d0c736533c92dd00e8108597048e6c42a445efd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T14:42:23Z","email":"raagaajava@yahoo.com","name":"Rajkumar Ganesan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T14:42:23Z","email":"raagaajava@yahoo.com","name":"Rajkumar Ganesan"},"message":"feat: implement clean architecture with micro-frontend modules\n\n- Add Clean Architecture layers (domain, application, infrastructure,\n  presentation, DI) across all modules (contacts, freight, books) and\n  admin app\n- Add Toast notification system and validation rules to shared packages\n- Add Tailwind CSS v4 theming with CSS custom properties\n- Add centralized API endpoints and backend-driven message handling\n- Add Axios response interceptors for structured error extraction\n- Move layouts and pages under presentation layer in all apps\n- Add comprehensive README.md and DEVELOPMENT.md documentation\n- Add .env.example files for both applications\n- Update .gitignore for tsbuildinfo and env files\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"7c3494a35cc348ca4cb089e0d343cfdd485a91fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/trees/7c3494a35cc348ca4cb089e0d343cfdd485a91fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/commits/8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commit/8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160","node_id":"C_kwDORaPS0toAKDhlMjI4OWE5NjM0ZDllNDllMWRhZDYyMGZmMWZiY2FhMjVjYWIxNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commit/4a04117e0853fc74188ba417028feda39b44b4df","sha":"4a04117e0853fc74188ba417028feda39b44b4df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/4a04117e0853fc74188ba417028feda39b44b4df"}],"sha":"8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/8e2289a9634d9e49e1dad620ff1fbcaa25cab160"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/commits/4a04117e0853fc74188ba417028feda39b44b4df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T11:14:30Z","email":"raagaajava@yahoo.com","name":"Rajkumar Ganesan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T11:14:30Z","email":"raagaajava@yahoo.com","name":"Rajkumar Ganesan"},"message":"feat: initialize CargoEz frontend micro frontend monorepo\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"afaa3013aa4c02ab9255ff8ccc0166f5bc109ced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/trees/afaa3013aa4c02ab9255ff8ccc0166f5bc109ced"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajkumarganesan93/cargoez2-frontend/git/commits/4a04117e0853fc74188ba417028feda39b