m/users/sahit402702/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahit402702/React-JS-Interview/commits/85a43664b5b2d9cf6355e325dc647a46b8988fe2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-27T14:29:01Z","email":"sahitirunagari@gmail.com","name":"sahit tirunagari"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-27T14:29:01Z","email":"sahitirunagari@gmail.com","name":"sahit tirunagari"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive deep-dive content for weak sections\n\n- Testing (08): Added testing-hooks, mocking-patterns, and integration-tests (1,705 new lines)\n  * renderHook patterns with async, context, useReducer examples\n  * vi.fn/spyOn, fetch mocking, timer mocking, MSW patterns\n  * Full Todo app and Shopping Cart integration tests\n\n- CSS & Styling (10): Added css-interview-concepts.ts (704 new lines)\n  * Specificity, box model, positioning, z-index/stacking contexts\n  * Flexbox and Grid complete guides with real examples\n  * CSS variables, animations/transitions (performance focus)\n  * Responsive design (container queries, clamp, dvh units)\n  * CSS methodologies (BEM, Modules, CSS-in-JS comparison)\n  * Advanced selectors (:has, :focus-visible), modern CSS 2024\n\n- Routing (11): Added routing-patterns.tsx (668 new lines)\n  * React Router v6 patterns, nested routes/Outlet\n  * Protected/role/permission routes\n  * Code splitting, URL state management, scroll restoration\n  * Data loaders/actions, modal routes, breadcrumbs\n\n- React Hooks (04): Added react-18-hooks.tsx (533 new lines)\n  * useTransition, useDeferredValue with practical examples\n  * useId for accessibility, useSyncExternalStore patterns\n  * React 19 preview hooks, stale closure pitfalls\n\n- State Management (05): Added redux-patterns.ts (476 new lines)\n  * Redux Toolkit slices, createAsyncThunk, RTK Query\n  * Selectors/createSelector, middleware patterns\n  * Redux vs Context vs Zustand comparison\n\n- React Patterns (06): Added controlled-uncontrolled.tsx (566 new lines)\n  * Controlled forms with real-time validation\n  * Uncontrolled forms, FormData API, hybrid patterns\n  * Multi-step form with useReducer, complete comparison table\n\n- System Design (09): Added design-a-chat.md (321 new lines)\n  * WhatsApp/Slack architecture with WebSocket patterns\n  * Optimistic messages, typing indicators, offline support\n\nTotal: 5,000+ new lines across 11 files\nAll files pass TypeScript checks with zero errors\nCoverage now comprehensive for senior React/JS interviews at UK MNCs","tree":{"sha":"1153e15ea090d8076905941fdf0f444f95b8f776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahit402702/React-JS-Interview/git/trees/1153e15ea090d8076905941fdf0f444f95b8f776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sahit402702/React-JS-Interview/git/commits/85a43664b5b2d9cf6355e325dc647a46b8988fe2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101111411?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sahit402702","id":101111411,"login":"sahit402702","node_id":"U_kgDOBgbWcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sahit402702","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"http