2026-10-08T22:00:30.864Z","repositoryId":1168860522,"sha":"920e6c21fceac87699ca60f6051fea8855e3b622"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:00:30.864Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/3eb59fa9ab695de4098d2e422820e5a81a9570ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T09:07:17Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T09:07:17Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"message":"Fix CLAUDE.md audit violations: enrich domain models, factory methods, event safety\n\n- billing-service: Replace silent .catch(() => {}) with logger.warn() so publish\n  failures are observable without crashing the use case (CreateInvoice, UpdateStatus)\n- billing-service: Add Invoice.canTransitionTo() state machine enforcing\n  draft→sent→paid/overdue/cancelled; paid and cancelled are terminal\n- billing-service: Add idempotency guard in EventHandler — check findByWorkOrderId\n  before creating an invoice; at-least-once Dapr delivery is now safe\n- billing-service: Add findByWorkOrderId to IInvoiceRepository + MongoInvoiceRepository\n- customer-service: Enrich Customer entity with static validate() using typed\n  ValidationError (not plain Error); add email format validation\n- customer-service: Enrich Vehicle entity with static validate() enforcing\n  make/model required and year bounds (1886 to current+1)\n- workorder-service: Add WorkOrder.Create() factory; propagate ValidationError\n  to gRPC InvalidArgument in CreateWorkOrderUseCase\n- inventory-service: Add Part.Create() factory with SKU/name validation; catch\n  ArgumentException in InventoryGrpcService → StatusCode.InvalidArgument\n- tests: Update all mock objects to include findByWorkOrderId; fix draft→paid\n  invalid-transition test to sent→paid; add factory, email, canTransitionTo,\n  publish-failure, and Vehicle tests (120 tests, all passing)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"130acea4538792950c41e1d9c6fe8786ea2ffc91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/trees/130acea4538792950c41e1d9c6fe8786ea2ffc91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/commits/3eb59fa9ab695de4098d2e422820e5a81a9570ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/3eb59fa9ab695de4098d2e422820e5a81a9570ac","node_id":"C_kwDORatlatoAKDNlYjU5ZmE5YWI2OTVkZTQwOThkMmU0MjI4MjBlNWE4MWE5NTcwYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9","sha":"9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9"}],"sha":"3eb59fa9ab695de4098d2e422820e5a81a9570ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/3eb59fa9ab695de4098d2e422820e5a81a9570ac"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:49:09Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:49:09Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"message":"Link CLAUDE.md from README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2ba95bb9241ebbe52994655de2cb78179eb5f82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/trees/f2ba95bb9241ebbe52994655de2cb78179eb5f82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/commits/9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9","node_id":"C_kwDORatlatoAKDljZmE1M2RmMmU5ODMyMzBkYjVmMmVjYmI3MmMxNDI1ZjRkNDg0Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712","sha":"5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712"}],"sha":"9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/9cfa53df2e983230db5f2ecbb72c1425f4d484c9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:48:06Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:48:06Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"message":"Add Claude architect specfile with design principles and patterns\n\nDefines how Claude should reason and code in this repository:\npragmatic clean architecture, bounded context rules, when to apply\nStrategy / Actor / Saga / CQRS, concurrency guidelines, testing\npyramid and naming conventions, error handling, and a pre-PR\nchecklist. Inspired by Fowler''s refactoring philosophy — patterns\nonly when they earn their keep.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b1fddc790479b47f067c9c1a9f51cb533fe7601","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/trees/0b1fddc790479b47f067c9c1a9f51cb533fe7601"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/commits/5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712","node_id":"C_kwDORatlatoAKDVkMjNjZjU5YmY1Yjg2MGM4NTVmM2YzMzg2MmM1MjUwYmY4Yjc3MTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294","sha":"3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294"}],"sha":"5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/5d23cf59bf5b860c855f3f33862c5250bf8b7712"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:37:55Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:37:55Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"message":"Add clean architecture and testing documentation\n\nREADME: adds a \"Running the tests\" section with commands for all five\nservices (Jest for Node.js, xUnit via dotnet or Docker for C#).\n\nARCHITECTURE.md: adds a \"Clean Architecture\" section describing the\nfour-layer structure applied to every service (Domain → Application →\nInfrastructure → Presentation), and a \"Testing\" section with test\ncounts, framework choices, and example BFF route-test pattern. Also\nupdates the BFF project-structure diagram to reflect the new\napplication/services and infrastructure/grpc directories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"956dc0e3ba31cf6eaf38e0ba5f6c897636d54941","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/trees/956dc0e3ba31cf6eaf38e0ba5f6c897636d54941"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/commits/3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294","node_id":"C_kwDORatlatoAKDNhYTUxZjE5ODM1MTlkNTQ4YTJiZWZhYzY3MzE5NzM4ZTFjZTAyOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795","sha":"4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795"}],"sha":"3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/3aa51f1983519d548a2befac67319738e1ce0294"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:37:48Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:37:48Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"message":"Remove old service layer files superseded by clean architecture\n\nThe monolithic service/publisher files for customer-service and\nbilling-service were replaced by domain/application/infrastructure\nlayers in the previous clean architecture commit. This removes the\nnow-orphaned originals.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a135028e47218b16a3b5a4b310bcf1120cc9d9df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/trees/a135028e47218b16a3b5a4b310bcf1120cc9d9df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/commits/4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795","node_id":"C_kwDORatlatoAKDQ2MjJmOWJmZjZhZmQ5ZjU2MTQ1NTk4MzU5Njg1ZjllZWY3MDU3OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/7111429777010f5ac3680230f876f206330de8de","sha":"7111429777010f5ac3680230f876f206330de8de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/7111429777010f5ac3680230f876f206330de8de"}],"sha":"4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/4622f9bff6afd9f56145598359685f9eef705795"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commits/7111429777010f5ac3680230f876f206330de8de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:33:55Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T08:33:55Z","email":"iandeherdt@gmail.com","name":"Ian De Herdt"},"message":"Refactor all services to clean architecture and add unit tests\n\nRestructures all 5 services (customer, billing, workorder, inventory, bff)\ninto Domain → Application → Infrastructure → Presentation layers.\nAdds a full unit-test suite for each service with mocked dependencies.\n\nServices (Node.js — Jest + ts-jest):\n- customer-service: 9 use cases, Prisma repositories, 18 tests passing\n- billing-service: 5 use cases, Mongoose repositories, 19 tests passing\n- bff: service interfaces (ICustomerService etc.) decoupling routes from\n  gRPC clients, Grpc* wrapper classes, 31 route tests via fastify.inject()\n\nServices (C# .NET 8 — xUnit + Moq + FluentAssertions):\n- workorder-service: 7 use cases, EF Core repository, 17 tests passing\n- inventory-service: 8 use cases, EF Core repositories, 10 tests passing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ef3ceb4c1ea9ca9c4c68107b1645cccb876b5fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/trees/1ef3ceb4c1ea9ca9c4c68107b1645cccb876b5fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/git/commits/7111429777010f5ac3680230f876f206330de8de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/iandeherdt/dapr-car-erp/commit/7111429777010f5ac3680230f876f20633