/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/cd9deb67c93d7721350e337e8b8cc9671bbe1325/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:39:21Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:39:21Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"data(iqm): record powered depth-ordering epoch 12\n\nFresh Garnet calibration of the day, the same-day simulator readiness\nrun, the two-job submission journal and the complete retrieved raw\ncounts. The frozen validator accepts the counts and the provider''s\npayload digests equal the journal''s for all 52 circuits and 57,344\nshots; both jobs are done. The calibration set differs from the eleven\nbefore it.\n\nThis is the twelfth and last epoch of the preregistered set: 624\ncircuits, 688,128 shots, 24 provider jobs, twelve distinct calibration\nsets. The endpoint analysis has not been run; this commit records the\ndata only. Design, layout, shot budgets and the protocol sources are\nunchanged since the first epoch.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"b7d8bbce7bbd6a71b1662f76829c27468a94d0c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/b7d8bbce7bbd6a71b1662f