rl":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/20ed754fb51e79f4e846e62f7ebf6a5feace17d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:50:14Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:50:14Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"build(deps): lock pyo3 0.29.3 in the engine, replay and fuzz crates\n\nThe engine lock moves from 0.29.2 to 0.29.3 with the checksums of the\nopen update proposal. The locks of the replay crate and of the fuzz\ntargets were still at 0.29.0; they now resolve the same release, so the\nrepository builds against one pyo3.\n\nThe fuzz lock was also out of date with its manifests: a locked\nresolution failed before this change (the replay crate''s serde and\nserde_json were missing from it) and passes now.\n\nThe dependency and environment map records the crate versions of the\nengine lock and binds its digest. The typed pin, the generated map and\nthe artefact bundle that binds the map''s digests are refreshed together.\n\nValidation: cargo check and clippy with the locked resolution for the\nengine and the replay crate, all targets; locked metadata for the fuzz\nmanifest; the 101 tests of the map, its evidence, the artefact bundle\nand the workflow contracts.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"89c941f7f5b15d41b6782fa65503a9ba97d95919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/89c941f7f5b15d41b6782fa65503a9ba97d95919"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/