tps://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/ec34a887ded537a3a4c65f69a2c2bac70bb1c9b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:14Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:14Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(program-ad): give the encoded-size capture test a cap with a margin\n\nThe test runs a capture of 655,360 encoded bytes under a cap that must admit\nexact byte accounting and refuse worst-case width accounting. The cap was\nexactly 2 MiB. The exact accounting needs about 2.10 MB in all: 2,099,958\nbytes under Python 3.11, where the hosted test job failed by 2,806 bytes,\nand a few kilobytes less under 3.12. The total also grows with the size of\nthe test module, whose source is charged: a 28-line test added to it on\n2026-10-05 was enough to break the test locally.\n\nThe cap is now 2.25 MiB (2,359,296 bytes): about 259 kB above the exact\ntotal, and still 134 kB below the 2.49 MB that four bytes per character\nwould need. The docstring states both figures.\n\nValidation: the capture tests of the module that use caps, 19 passed.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"45eb178aa09bc4fe339fcb4fbe0490d5d6d6215e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/45eb178aa09bc4fe339fcb4fbe0490d5d6d6215e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/ec34a887ded537a3a4c65f69a2c2bac70bb1c9b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/ec34a887ded537a3a4c65f69a2c2bac70bb1c9b6","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGVjMzRhODg3ZGVkNTM3YTNhNGM2NWY2OWEyYzJiYWM3MGJiMWM5YjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec","sha":"56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec"}],"sha":"ec34a887ded537a3a4c65f69a2c2bac70bb1c9b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/ec34a887ded537a3a4c65f69a2c2bac70bb1c9b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:09Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:42:09Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(studio-web): observe the first worker at construction, not by polling\n\nOne test of the owned Kuramoto hook waited until a poll saw one active\nworker and then replaced the input. A worker that is already warm finishes\nits run before the first poll, the count is back at zero, and the wait\noutlasts the test''s five-second limit. Alone the test passes, after any other\ntest of the file it hangs: an instrumented copy showed the phase \"finished\"\nwith zero active workers 100 ms after mounting. The timed-out test then left\nits hook mounted, which disturbed later tests of the file at random. The\nhosted web job reached this step for the first time and failed there.\n\nThe test now observes the worker''s construction through a subclass, the way\nthe neighbouring cancellation test does, and replaces the input in the same\nturn. The file is left without lint findings and formatted, and the web\nsource ceiling is lowered to 683 findings in 99 files, 169 unformatted.\n\nValidation: the file six times in a row, 10 of 10 each; the whole resource\nadmission step with its per-file exact thresholds three times, 158 of 158\neach, against real built kernels; type checking; the ceiling in both modes.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"46640c0d38c0374606c626d3aae025df963e28ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/46640c0d38c0374606c626d3aae025df963e28ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDU2YzVkNTIxZDlmNDUyNDRiOGVmNmE2NzJlYTY4ZTI0OTI2OGQ5ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec","sha":"f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec"}],"sha":"56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/56c5d521d9f45244b8ef6a672ea68e249268d9ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:33:30Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:33:30Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(container): copy the declared contract consumers into the image\n\nThe shared contract ownership check requires every declared consumer of a\ncontract to exist as a file. The reproduction image held none of the\nTypeScript contract modules, the program compiler pair or the WebAssembly\nkernel crate, so 74 tests of two modules failed there with \"missing contract\nowner\", as the first container run that completed again shows (78 failures\nin six modules; the other four are repaired by the previous image change).\n\nThe image now copies those consumers. Nothing of them is built or run in the\nimage.\n\nNot validated by a local image build; the tests that read the image\ndefinition pass (95). The hosted container workflow decides.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"eedc84ed73f1d211042753dd1c38eb0c1839ff40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/eedc84ed73f1d211042753dd1c38eb0c1839ff40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGY1MGY4MTIyZTllZWVkMGY5Y2ZiMmViZWZlNGY1OWUzNDgyNGUxZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5","sha":"6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5"}],"sha":"f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/f50f8122e9eeed0f9cfb2ebefe4f59e34824e1ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:33:28Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:33:28Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"ci(test): resolve the pinned Rust toolchain before the tests run\n\nThe general test jobs install no Rust toolchain. The runner''s rustc is a\nshim that downloads the toolchain pinned in rust-toolchain.toml on first\nuse, and that first use was a test asking for the compiler version. On one\nof three runners of the last run the call returned a failure, which ended\nthe job at 9 percent; the other two passed the same test. The command''s\nerror output was not captured, so a failed download is the likely cause,\nnot an established one.\n\nThe job now resolves the toolchain in a step of its own, with three\nattempts, before any test runs.\n\nValidation: workflow environment audit, advisory step audit and the workflow\ntests, 100 passed.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"70e1d8a24cb774e63c63e7b7638da7bcc37a3755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/70e1d8a24cb774e63c63e7b7638da7bcc37a3755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDZjMzRjYmYzZjliOTlkN2M5YThhYjEyNzI5MjU3ZWRmYTlhM2RmYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1","sha":"aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1"}],"sha":"6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6c34cbf3f9b99d7c9a8ab12729257edfa9a3dfb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:33:25Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:33:25Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(studio-web): leave the touched parameter editor test clean and formatted\n\nThe web source ceiling requires a changed file to have no lint finding and\nto be formatted. The parameter editor test gained a case in the previous\nchange but kept its five non-null assertions and its unformatted lines, so\nthe hosted web job failed at the ceiling step.\n\nThe assertions are replaced by an explicit check and by destructuring, the\nfile is formatted, and the ceiling is lowered to the new measurement: 684\nlint findings in 100 files, 170 unformatted files.\n\nValidation: the parameter feature tests, 78 passed, with the four exact\nthresholds; type checking; the ceiling in both modes, also against the\npushed head.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"7648601885be52c48275fb851b66ed75ecaec2ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/7648601885be52c48275fb851b66ed75ecaec2ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGFhYTdiNjFjMjViMmZhYzkxZmY5MDU2MzU4MDQzOTZiODY0YjQ3YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592","sha":"e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592"}],"sha":"aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/aaa7b61c25b2fac91ff905635804396b864b47a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:32:41Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:32:41Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(quality): take syntax digests from unparsed text, not from the syntax dump\n\nTwo tools hashed ast.dump of a syntax node and compared the digest with a\ncommitted value. ast.dump writes a different text for the same node under\nPython 3.11, 3.12 and 3.13 (the type-parameter field arrived in 3.12, empty\nfields are omitted since 3.13), so the committed values held on 3.12 only:\n\n- the Kuramoto convention page: its check reported drift on the hosted 3.13\n  test job and, on an export of the committed tree, under 3.11 and 3.13\n  locally;\n- the split boundary guard: 116 \"unreviewed dynamic import\" problems under\n  3.13 against a baseline that is clean under 3.12.\n\nBoth now hash ast.unparse of the node. Over the 3,588 top-level\ndeclarations of the package and the sibling oscillator package the unparsed\ntext gives the same digest under 3.11, 3.12, 3.13 and 3.14.\n\nThe convention outputs are regenerated. The 58 dynamic-import reviews are\nre-keyed mechanically: for every row the old digest was first matched to\nexactly one call in its source file, then replaced by the new digest of that\nsame call (12 distinct digests); sources, scopes, roles and reasons are\nunchanged.\n\nValidation: the boundary guard reports 0 problems under four interpreter\nversions; the convention check agrees under 3.11, 3.12 and 3.13 (throwaway\nenvironments); the tools'' tests, 264 passed; strict typing, lint, format.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"c11fbf783031479e06735cc35700f485a01168d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/c11fbf783031479e06735cc35700f485a01168d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGUwMWUwM2JiNjE3Y2Q4ZmI3MmUxYzA5OTJmZWYyM2YxYzI5ODQ1OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172","sha":"cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172"}],"sha":"e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/e01e03bb617cd8fb72e1c0992fef23f1c2984592"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:40:58Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:40:58Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(container): give the reproduction image what four tests read\n\nThe reproduction image is built from an explicit list of copied paths. Four\ntests pass on the hosted runner and fail only in the image, as the last\ncompleted container run shows:\n\n- the workflow environment audit reads the lock of every tool a job\n  installs; the shell-lint, licence-lint and mutation locks, added on\n  2026-10-04 and 2026-10-05, were not copied;\n- the Kuramoto convention matrix names the tests of the sibling oscillator\n  package, and its generated page drifts without them (two tests);\n- the public comparison test records the installed distribution version, and\n  the image had the sources on the import path but no installed package.\n\nThe image now copies the three locks and the sibling''s tests, and installs\nthe package without dependencies as the hosted test jobs do, checking that\nits metadata resolves.\n\nNot validated by a local image build: the machine is short of memory and\ndisk. The tests that read the image definition pass (139); the hosted\ncontainer workflow decides.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"191e23fb7f19e75ddc7b62fef73e49c42e6ae40d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/191e23fb7f19e75ddc7b62fef73e49c42e6ae40d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGNmODJmY2I4NGFlYjAzOTc4ZTJmN2RhNzg2MDM1NDRlNDkzN2ExNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2","sha":"e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2"}],"sha":"cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/cf82fcb84aeb03978e2f7da78603544e4937a172"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:12:48Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T08:12:48Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(tests): bound test identifiers and shorten eleven overlong ones\n\npytest builds the identifier of a parametrised case from the value when the\nvalue is a string, a byte string or a number, and a verbose run prints it on\none line. Two cases passed a mebibyte of source text and so had mebibyte-long\nidentifiers; five more had identifiers of 28 to 65 thousand characters.\n\nThe hosted runner needed 17 to 22 minutes to pass one mebibyte line on. In\nthe general test job on f96be9890 the log stands still from 02:28:52 to\n02:47:37 and again to 03:04:49 around one such line, while pytest itself\nreports about six minutes for the whole selection. The container workflow\nprints both lines and has been cancelled at its time limit on every run\nsince 2026-10-04; its last completed run shows four pauses of nine to twelve\nminutes at exactly these cases.\n\nThe eleven cases now state short identifiers. The shared test configuration\nstops collection when any identifier exceeds 2,000 characters and names the\ncase, so a new one cannot return unnoticed. The longest identifier of the\n26,258 collected tests is now 1,142 characters.\n\nValidation: the limit''s own tests, among them two nested sessions under the\nshared configuration (a short probe runs; an overlong one ends with a usage\nerror, runs nothing and prints no long line); the five changed modules; a\ncollection of the whole suite; strict typing; the contribution guide\ndescribes the rule.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"b6ad398aed20a80139014c4683d7335f697a510e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/b6ad398aed20a80139014c4683d7335f697a510e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGUzNTVkMjFiNDg4ZTk5MzhiYWFkYzY2Mzc0NzAyNWRmMzFlNDkzZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/0c57ce54d03d45073e692c85dabea21df0871d4e","sha":"0c57ce54d03d45073e692c85dabea21df0871d4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/0c57ce54d03d45073e692c85dabea21df0871d4e"}],"sha":"e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/e355d21b488e9938baadc663747025df31e493f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/0c57ce54d03d45073e692c85dabea21df0871d4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:56:47Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:56:47Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"feat(quality): hold the knm and otoc mutation targets to measured ceilings\n\nTwo mutation targets had runner scripts and April baselines but no recorded\nceiling, so the weekly gate did not run them.\n\nBoth were measured with the gate''s own functions and the pinned mutmut 2.5.1\non an export of the committed tree: the coupling Hamiltonian bridge has 298\nmutants of which 85 survive (14.6 minutes), the out-of-time-order correlator\nmodule 432 of which 125 survive (5.7 minutes); no mutant timed out and none\nwas left untested. The ceiling file records both with the digests of their\nsources, and the mutation testing page lists the measurement. The counts are\nnot comparable with the April baselines: the pinned release generates more\nmutants for the same modules.\n\nThe weekly run now takes about 26 minutes of mutation time instead of 6; its\nlimit is 180 minutes.\n\nValidation: the gate''s tests, 31 passed; the ceiling file loads with three\ntargets whose modules and runners exist; documentation surface audit.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"5cb341650ed386834f64dfc21ea13840c405da23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/5cb341650ed386834f64dfc21ea13840c405da23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/0c57ce54d03d45073e692c85dabea21df0871d4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.gith