anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(studio-web): cover a selection owned by another parameter\n\nThe parameter editor passes the selected index to a coupling table only when\nthe selection belongs to that table''s parameter. Every editor test used a\nsource with one parameter, so the other branch never ran and the exact\nbranch threshold of the parameter feature failed (99.59 percent). The hosted\nweb job reached that step only after earlier steps were repaired.\n\nA new test gives the source a second parameter, selects a coupling edge,\nthen an element of the other parameter, and requires that no edge stays\nselected.\n\nValidation: the parameter feature tests, 78 passed, with the four exact\nthresholds of the hosted step; type checking; the web source ceiling is\nunchanged (the test file has the same number of lint findings as before).\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"a2e6a3dc79bd6d2459b2c424dfb5c7529c733d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/a2e6a3dc79bd6d2459b2c424dfb5c7529c733d3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/a463617ec2cb32498991e33515b72fae21bfad8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/a463617ec2cb32498991e33515b72fae21bfad8e","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGE0NjM2MTdlYzJjYjMyNDk4OTkxZTMzNTE1YjcyZmFlMjFiZmFkOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0","sha":"c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0"}],"sha":"a463617ec2cb32498991e33515b72fae21bfad8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a463617ec2cb32498991e33515b72fae21bfad8e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:44:21Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T07:44:21Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(differentiable): register the effect admission and capture modules\n\nThe module hardening registry lists every differentiable module with its\ntests and diagnostic surfaces, and its audit fails on a module without a\nrow. Ten modules added with effect admission had none: the six effect\nmodules, captured state and its memory admission, tape binding and the\nscatter tracer. The hosted general test jobs stop at their first failure and\nreached this audit only now.\n\nEach module gets a row naming its own test module and what it diagnoses.\n\nValidation: the registry audit tests, 7 passed (the live-registry test failed\nbefore); strict typing; the evidence tests that cite the registry, 325 passed.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"306d3fdc0fac26f184970ca5761b16c9bf5c1459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/306d3fdc0fac26f184970ca5761b16c9bf5c1459"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGM5MjUyMTlhZjVmMTliZGM3ODdjMTFkMzU1MDk2NTRiMTY4Nzg2ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/8c0a5e7e130c0df1d9972acd2979e1b6fdd36358","sha":"8c0a5e7e130c0df1d9972acd2979e1b6fdd36358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/8c0a5e7e130c0df1d9972acd2979e1b6fdd36358"}],"sha":"c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/c925219af5f19bdc787c11d35509654b168786e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/8c0a5e7e130c0df1d9972acd2979e1b6fdd36358/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:18:12Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T02:18:12Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"docs(architecture): record the repository boundary\n\nThe repository had no record of what belongs in it. Ownership of every unit\nand tracked path exists as checked data, and imports against the declared\ndependency direction are frozen in a baseline, but no page said so or said\nwhat stays outside.\n\ndocs/adr/0001-repository-boundary.md states the decision (one repository\nuntil a split is released), what the repository contains and by which owner\nin the map, what it does not contain, the risks accepted, the commands that\ncheck the boundary, and what the record does not claim: no split has been\ncarried out, the destination names are planned targets, the map is not a\nlist of maintainers, and nothing is relicensed. The decisions page gains a\nshort record that points to it, and the documentation navigation lists it.\n\nThe figures in the record are dated measurements with the command that\nreproduces them; the generated capability files count the new page.\n\nValidation: documentation surface audit. A local strict documentation build\nwas still running when this was committed; the hosted strict build decides.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"6bf9f5e7beee2db6b384c3c6c375cd77a2b7e755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/6bf9f5e7beee2db6b384c3c6c375cd77a2b7e755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/8c0a5e7e130c0df1d9972acd2979e1b6fdd36358","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/pri