m/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/4e1ff0e411833dfeb58f9c154065888767cc8441/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:53:29Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:53:29Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(studio-web): resolve undici, brace-expansion and markdown-it to patched releases\n\nNine open dependency alerts on the default branch name three development\ndependencies of the web workspace: undici below 7.29.1 (six advisories, one\nof high severity), brace-expansion below 5.0.12 and markdown-it below 14.3.1.\nundici arrives through the test DOM and the federation type plugin, the other\ntwo through the API documentation generator; none is part of the built\nportal.\n\nThe workspace overrides now resolve each to its first patched release and the\nlockfile is regenerated. The changelog records the three versions.\n\nValidation: frozen install; type checking; the API documentation generator\nwith warnings as errors; a portal build into a temporary directory; the unit\ntests with two workers give the same result before and after the change\n(1,239 passed, and the same 157 that need native evidence and a built worker\nwhich the hosted job prepares in earlier steps).\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"702f856c7fdd7ecebe1118ab407c90f34c52e4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/702f856c7fdd7ecebe1118ab407c90f34c52e4b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-q