following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/f96be9890cfeaab2775fbd5be28533a5642a6ea8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:45:42Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:45:42Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(program-ad): give the native linear algebra objectives a static side\n\nTwo integration tests of the native replay derived the matrix side inside the\nobjective, from the square root of the parameter count converted to an\ninteger. Effect admission refuses an integer conversion of anything derived\nfrom the traced array before the objective runs, so both tests failed at the\npublic entry point. The hosted general test jobs stop at their first failure\nand had not reached them.\n\nThe objectives now reshape to their fixed 4x4 and 5x5 sides. Admission does\nnot treat the size, shape or rank of the traced array as static metadata;\nthat stays as it is here.\n\nValidation: the module''s 12 tests pass with the real native engine; strict\ntyping, lint, format.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"5afcf2768da3a214278b9b8a4456c742e243133c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/5afcf2768da3a214278b9b8a4456c742e243133c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/f96be9890cfeaab2775fbd5be28533a5642a6ea8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/f96be9890cfeaab2775fbd5be28533a5642a6ea8","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGY5NmJlOTg5MGNmZWFhYjI3NzVmYmQ1YmUyODUzM2E1NjQyYTZlYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e","sha":"6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e"}],"sha":"f96be9890cfeaab2775fbd5be28533a5642a6ea8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/f96be9890cfeaab2775fbd5be28533a5642a6ea8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:45:39Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:45:39Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(program-ad): examine trace arrays below the effect gate\n\nOlder tests of the trace value layer took the traced array out of an\nobjective through a captured list, or called an observer between two traced\noperations. Effect admission refuses both before the objective runs, so those\ntests failed at the public entry point without reaching what they test.\n\nA shared helper now builds the parameter trace array from the same trace\ncontext, node kind, parameter names and unit tangents as the public entry\npoint, and offers a reserved trace scope that binds the context to an owned\nreservation in the entry point''s order. The five value modules take their\narrays from it. The storage tests measure what one traced operation keeps\nreserved inside that scope and keep their value, gradient and release\nassertions through the public entry point. Tests of an objective that fails\nafter an operation keep running through the public entry point.\n\nSmaller repairs: two malformed-call cases put their two lambdas on separate\nlines, because the source frontend cannot tell two lambdas on one line apart;\nthe package-root class test encodes its check in the returned value; the\nshape test selects the method form by class instead of by attribute lookup.\n\nThe exact coverage threshold of the trace value module had three uncovered\nplaces since integer conversion refusals and scatter dispatch were added:\nthe cohort never reached them. Three direct tests cover them.\n\nThe helper is listed in the trace value quality ratchet, its two workflow\nmirrors and the test typing policy; the generated capability files count it.\n\nValidation: the cohort of the hosted step, now 1,643 tests, passes with the\nchange (207 of 1,641 failed before); the trace value thresholds are exact\nagain; strict typing and the docstring ratchet pass.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"5746c8d1c7aba84ec7c19d46e08bbfaf3c37596b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/5746c8d1c7aba84ec7c19d46e08bbfaf3c37596b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDZiZWIwM2I1ZmM1OTk0YTFlODRmYWNlZTc3ZTkzNzc4MDA2NDhmN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8","sha":"134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8"}],"sha":"6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6beb03b5fc5994a1e84facee77e9377800648f7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:44:50Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:44:50Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(program-ad): admit direct dispatch, native exceptions and static selectors\n\nEffect admission refused several forms that carry no captured write, no\nforeign callback and no ambient random draw. 207 of the 1,641 tests of the\nwhole-program trace value cohort failed on them or on test idioms the policy\nrightly refuses; the hosted job has failed at that step since admission\nlanded.\n\nAdmitted, each decided before the objective runs:\n\n- a traced array''s own __array_function__ called with a native NumPy\n  identity. The array never calls the identity: it traces a supported\n  function and refuses any other by name;\n- a native exception built without keyword operands. Its payload reaches the\n  caller, so a traced value in it is refused with its own detail;\n- type(value) with one operand; the three-operand form creates a class and\n  stays refused;\n- slice(...) and object();\n- np.sign and np.heaviside, which now reach the runtime and are refused there\n  by their own derivative-losing contract instead of as a foreign callback.\n\nThe captured-state fingerprint binds a captured slice, the ellipsis and a\nparametrised callable alias as values. Before, an objective that captured a\nstatic selector ran and was then refused as unsupported storage.\n\nCaptured writes, observer callbacks, class creation, keyword-built exceptions\nand traced exception payloads keep their refusals. The programming guide\nlists the admitted forms, including the batching transform admitted earlier.\n\nValidation: the adjoint lane, 1,009 tests, with its strict typing, docstring\nratchet and both exact coverage\nthresholds (1,183 and 1,650 statements, 100 percent with branches).\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"a0e226d42e9806778d0629af48149606138a014b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/a0e226d42e9806778d0629af48149606138a014b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDEzNGY4MDZlMDgxYjVlY2ZjZDMxZDJlZTA4NTFmNjA3NGQ5Yjk5ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/545356be33eb00ad09db52d4862248d787887439","sha":"545356be33eb00ad09db52d4862248d787887439","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/545356be33eb00ad09db52d4862248d787887439"}],"sha":"134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/134f806e081b5ecfcd31d2ee0851f6074d9b99d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/545356be33eb00ad09db52d4862248d787887439/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:11:58Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T01:11:58Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(studio): admit only measurement noise when reproducing trace fixtures\n\nThe lowering fixture of the compiler trace holds a phase delta and an\noperator error measured through the reference linear algebra. Their last\nbits differ between platforms (-6.123233995736767e-17 here,\n-6.123233995736765e-17 on the hosted runner), and the record digest, the\nlowering''s pass digest and the document digest bind them, so the exact\ncomparison with the committed fixture failed on the hosted runner.\n\nThe reproduction test now requires equal documents where the measurement is\nbit-equal. Any other measurement must agree within 1e-14, and everything\nexcept the two measured values and exactly the three digests that bind them\nmust still be equal. A second test proves the comparison on the committed\nfixture: a neighbouring float with other digests passes; a stale digest, a\nvalue beyond the noise, a changed unrelated digest, a malformed digest and a\nmissing pass each fail.\n\nThe record still binds its raw measurement, so the same pass has different\nrecord digests on different platforms; that is unchanged here.\n\nValidation: the module''s 48 tests pass locally; strict typing, lint, format.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"f7e4814ee75f1aff3e3ea20f885325a990e30001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/f7e4814ee75f1aff3e3ea20f885325a990e30001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/545356be33eb00ad09db52d4862248d787887439","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/com