 of pyproject.toml, the\nexternal validation environment manifest and the differentiable API\nreference. Those files changed after the last refresh, so the committed map\nno longer matched the live one. The hosted general test jobs stop at their\nfirst failure and reached this comparison only after the earlier failures\nwere repaired.\n\nThe map is regenerated from the live evidence (six digests, same size), and\nits new digest is propagated into the external validation artefact bundle and\nthe bundle''s reviewer summary. Nothing else binds the bundle.\n\nValidation: the dependency map tests and the external validation tests, 78\ntests, pass; both failed before on the stale digests.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"78c941de600b6c8433711e5b9ffd22273f90e0f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/78c941de600b6c8433711e5b9ffd22273f90e0f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/0dda13b158165827cc1d8f69cd57c4000bb475bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/0dda13b158165827cc1d8f69cd57c4000bb475bf","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDBkZGExM2IxNTgxNjU4MjdjYzFkOGY2OWNkNTdjNDAwMGJiNDc1YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e","sha":"07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e"}],"sha":"0dda13b158165827cc1d8f69cd57c4000bb475bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/0dda13b158165827cc1d8f69cd57c4000bb475bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:47:05Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:47:05Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(quality): test timed-out mutants again before counting them\n\nThe first run of the mutation gate on the committed tree, on a busy\nmachine, reported 48 survivors and 2 timeouts where the recorded measurement\nhas 50 and 0. mutmut calls a mutant timed out when its tests ran ten times\nlonger than the unmutated tests did at the start of the run, so load turns\nordinary mutants into timeouts, and the tool does not test a cached mutant\nagain.\n\nThe gate now applies each timed-out mutant again, runs the target''s runner\nonce under a fixed limit (--retest-limit, 300 seconds by default), restores\nthe module and counts the mutant as survived, noticed or, beyond that limit,\ntimed out. A mutant that cannot be applied stops the gate.\n\nValidation: 31 tests, among them a runner that hangs once (the mutant is\nthen counted as noticed) and one that always hangs (counted as timed out),\nand a tool that cannot apply a mutant; 237 statements and 82 branches at 100\npercent; strict typing, NumPy docstrings, lint and format. The gate on the\ncommitted tree: koopman 148 mutants, 98 noticed, 50 survived, no timeout, 0\nproblems.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"b25197e626d72b438b2651f1f0fd4afdc941f16a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/b25197e626d72b438b2651f1f0fd4afdc941f16a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDA3ZmRhZWJlMzJmZTFlYTdlODJhZmI2MTc2OTg0Y2MzMDhlNGExMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c","sha":"a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c"}],"sha":"07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/07fdaebe32fe1ea7e82afb6176984cc308e4a12e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:23:36Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:23:36Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"feat(quality): make the weekly mutation run real and hold its survivors\n\nThe weekly mutation job reported success on all 24 runs since 2026-04-20.\nIts last run tested no mutant: the runner script was committed without its\nexecute permission, the tool stopped with a permission error, and the\nworkflow discarded the failure under a tolerated job. The result files of\nthe three most recent runs are empty.\n\nThe three runner scripts are executable now. mutmut 2.5.1 is pinned with\nhashes in requirements-ci-mutation.txt (the newest release of the line whose\ncommand line the runners use). tools/audit_mutation_survivors.py runs every\ntarget recorded in tools/mutation_survivor_ceiling.json on an export of the\ncommitted tree, because the tool rewrites the module it mutates, and fails\nwhen the tool cannot run, when a mutant is left untested, when the mutant\ncount differs from the record, when survivors or timeouts rise, and when a\ncount fell without the ceiling being lowered. A changed source or release\nneeds a recorded rebaseline. Mutants noticed slowly count as noticed; that\nlabel depends on machine load.\n\nFirst recorded measurement, analysis/koopman.py: 148 mutants, 97 killed, 50\nsurvived, 0 timed out, 1 suspicious. The other two documented targets have\nno ceiling yet and are not gated.\n\nThe weekly workflow runs the gate without any tolerance; its three rows\nleave the advisory policy (7 sites remain). A per-push job tests the gate\nitself with the pinned tool; 207 jobs.\n\nValidation: 30 tests with real mutmut runs in real Git repositories; 220\nstatements and 78 branches at 100 percent; strict typing, NumPy docstrings,\nlint and format; shell lint and format of the runners; 201 workflow and\npolicy tests; actionlint; modularity, inventory, advisory, licence and\nnaming audits pass. The gate''s run on the committed tree follows this\ncommit, because it needs the executable runner in HEAD.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"f7cf1a61d78b02dc2a0e8c8b37d1ba7341c3917d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/f7cf1a61d78b02dc2a0e8c8b37d1ba7341c3917d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGE5NGRjZGUyOTFlMjJkYWVjNmZjYjhmODM3MDMyZWMyYjcwYmJhNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/922d7c4076265243b0ddc27e403eabdcc9340989","sha":"922d7c4076265243b0ddc27e403eabdcc9340989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/922d7c4076265243b0ddc27e403eabdcc9340989"}],"sha":"a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a94dcde291e22daec6fcb8f837032ec2b70bba6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/922d7c4076265243b0ddc27e403eabdcc9340989/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:15:29Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:15:29Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(studio): cover compiler trace requests in the compile handler''s own tests\n\nThe compile recompute lane borrowed the compiler trace test file to cover\nthe handler''s trace paths. One test of that file compares a stored fixture\nwith a float that differed in its last digit on a hosted runner\n(-6.123233995736767e-17 against the stored ...765e-17), so the lane failed.\n\nThe cohort is back to its three files. The handler''s own test file gains\ntrace tests that do not depend on a stored float: a trace request emits\nnative pass evidence and a script that recomputes and checks its own digest,\nthe level defaults to two, and eight unsupported settings are refused.\n\nValidation: the lane''s cohort passes (95 tests) and reaches 100 percent for\nits three modules; the lane''s gate test passes; strict typing, NumPy\ndocstrings, lint and format.\n\nOpen, not addressed here: the stored compiler trace fixture contains a\nplatform-dependent float inside a digest; the same comparison can fail in\nthe web lane on another runner.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"87849ffcbe87355939f2c4bf334e0a77ba628830","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/87849ffcbe87355939f2c4bf334e0a77ba628830"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/922d7c4076265243b0ddc27e403eabdcc9340989","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/