 Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:15:26Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(ci): serve the workspace page from the source host of the browser tests\n\nTwo result inspector tests open the root of the source host. The step that\nprepares that host copied the TypeScript and JSON files of the workspace but\nnot its page, so the root answered 404 and both tests failed on their first\nhosted run. The page is copied with them.\n\nValidation: reproduced locally with the same layout: without the page the\nroot answers 404 and both tests fail; with it both pass. actionlint passes.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"1c70f2a07be81dc61363cc1b30c2399520ecc54f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/1c70f2a07be81dc61363cc1b30c2399520ecc54f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/ad2a7e92146ac4234ca2d3076b11927b66f452ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/ad2a7e92146ac4234ca2d3076b11927b66f452ff","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGFkMmE3ZTkyMTQ2YWM0MjM0Y2EyZDMwNzZiMTE5MjdiNjZmNDUyZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1","sha":"6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1"}],"sha":"ad2a7e92146ac4234ca2d3076b11927b66f452ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/ad2a7e92146ac4234ca2d3076b11927b66f452ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:15:23Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:15:23Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(workspace): restore codec functions through a restricted unpickler\n\nThe serialization audit refuses plain unpickling outside a reviewed wrapper,\nand the codec identity test used it. The test now resolves its stream with\nan unpickler that admits only the two historical codec functions of the\nworkspace module; another global is refused before it is resolved, and a new\ntest shows that refusal. The pickle stream and the identity assertions are\nunchanged.\n\nValidation: 43 tests of the file; the serialization audit reports no unsafe\ncall; the security job''s scanner, waiver audit and advisory audit pass\nlocally; strict typing, NumPy docstrings, lint and format.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"7c49469c4e24ca52e0e7b609f628da1678d44698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/7c49469c4e24ca52e0e7b609f628da1678d44698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDZmYmMxNDcxODNmYmQ1MDBlODg4Y2VlMTBhY2VkMTI5MTlhMTQ2YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b","sha":"d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b"}],"sha":"6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/6fbc147183fbd500e888cee10aced12919a146b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:14:36Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T00:14:36Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(program-ad): admit the batching transform, type aliases and array methods\n\nThe effect admission of 2026-10-02 refuses any call whose identity it does\nnot know. Three supported uses were refused with it:\n\n- grad over the package''s own vmap, a documented composition. The transform\n  now has an effect contract: vmap of one source-visible function, mapped\n  over the leading axis and called with one positional batch, is inspected\n  like a directly called helper, with the batch''s own activity and storage\n  provenance. Axis options, native callables and other call shapes stay\n  refused. The captured state fingerprint binds the transform by identity\n  and code, as it binds native callables.\n- a generic type alias used in cast, which the captured state fingerprint\n  rejected as unsupported storage. It is type metadata and is fingerprinted\n  as an intrinsic, like the typing constructs already admitted.\n- seven methods the traced array implements: squeeze, swapaxes, take,\n  repeat, expand_dims, argmax and argmin. They are admitted as read methods;\n  take, argmax and argmin keep the refusal of a caller-owned output array,\n  and the selection methods reach the registry''s named refusal again.\n\nThe unified API test counted calls inside its objective. Writing captured\nstorage is refused by design, so the test now uses a pure objective for the\nready report and keeps the counting objective to show the refusal, its\ndiagnostic and that neither report executed it.\n\nValidation: 30 new or changed tests through the public entry points with\nexact values and gradients; the adjoint lane (19 test files) at 100 percent\nfor the admission, captured state and dispatch modules; the unified API step\nof the trace lane (356 tests) at 100 percent; strict typing, NumPy\ndocstrings, lint and format. Parity: no other language holds these lists.\nBenchmarks: not applicable, no numerical routine changed.\n\nNot repaired here: about 200 older tests of the trace value cohort observe\nor fail inside their objectives through captured callbacks, which the\nadmission refuses before execution. They need a decision on an observer\ncontract and remain red.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"618e29315cdd2143065fbe1adc73fdf64e26e4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/618e29315cdd2143065fbe1adc73fdf64e26e4b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGQ3MzIxZWExZTk0MmVlNWQxZjM0ODQ5NWEzMWViMWFhMmJmOGY2NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/9f6c9e84c1b7af95d2a3ee1eecdec49fd86ca269","sha":"9f6c9e84c1b7af95d2a3ee1eecdec49fd86ca269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/9f6c9e84c1b7af95d2a3ee1eecdec49fd86ca269"}],"sha":"d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/d7321ea1e942ee5d1f348495a31eb1aa2bf8f65b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/9f6c9e84c1b7af95d2a3ee1eecdec49fd86ca269/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T23:16:21Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T23:16:21Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"feat(quality): record every tolerated workflow failure and its outcome\n\nA job or a step with continue-on-error, and a shell command whose failure is\ndiscarded, report nothing when they break. The reason for each lived in a\nworkflow comment, when it was written at all, and nothing noticed a new one.\n\ntools/audit_advisory_workflow_steps.py reads every tracked workflow and\nfinds jobs and steps with continue-on-error and run steps that contain\n\"|| true\", \"|| :\" or \"set +e\". Each site needs a row in\ntools/advisory_workflow_policy.json with the reason and exactly one outcome:\npromotion (the condition under which it becomes blocking), permanent (why it\nnever decides a result) or undecided (what is missing for either). An\nunrecorded site, a row without a site, a changed tolerance count and a\nmalformed row fail the gate; undecided rows are printed on every run.\n\nThe ten existing sites are recorded: three staged with the conditions their\nworkflow headers state, four permanent (exit-trap cleanups and summary\nsteps), three undecided because no condition is written anywhere.\n\nRegistered as a job of the assurance policy category (the static analysis\nworkflow is at its size limit), in the pre-push gates, the typing policy and\nthe contributing guide; 206 jobs.\n\nValidation: 25 tests with real workflows in real Git repositories; 155\nstatements and 64 branches at 100 percent with the script run; strict\ntyping, NumPy docstrings, lint and format; 167 workflow contract tests;\nactionlint; modularity, environment, inventory and naming audits pass.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"1ca8d335fc6d64f0d29071c8c0bc77a7e2126214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/1ca8d335fc6d64f0d29071c8c0bc77a7e2126214"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/9f6c9e84c1b7af95d2a3ee1eecdec49fd86ca269","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"log