DQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a7986a61f267ea30b8da7017bf7407068a4dc2ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:27:43Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:27:43Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(quality): type the experimental worker strictly\n\nThe standalone worker of the experimental lane had 17 strict typing\nfindings: it reads a task, split, model and latent batch from a request and\nindexes them after a nested call has refused anything that is not a complete\nrecord, which the type checker cannot see. The bindings are annotated at\nthat point, with the reason in a comment; no statement that runs changed.\n\nThe worker directory joins the strict type check of the import guard in the\nlint job and in the pre-push gates, and its source surface inventory row is\nclosed: 25 surfaces gated, 3 open, 3 evidence.\n\nValidation: strict typing of the worker directory; 98 experimental lane\ntests, including the standalone worker run without the parent package; 128\ngate and inventory tests; lint, format and NumPy docstrings; actionlint.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"056679ba6343e020e77276cb8143f04682673a16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/056679ba6343e020e77276cb8143f04682673a16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/a7986a61f267ea30b8da7017bf7407068a4dc2ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/a7986a61f267ea30b8da7017bf7407068a4dc2ab","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGE3OTg2YTYxZjI2N2VhMzBiOGRhNzAxN2JmNzQwNzA2OGE0ZGMyYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/5fd943ae28089cef72e5a28f9ab081179f3439a2","sha":"5fd943ae28089cef72e5a28f9ab081179f3439a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/5fd943ae28089cef72e5a28f9ab081179f3439a2"}],"sha":"a7986a61f267ea30b8da7017bf7407068a4dc2ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a7986a61f267ea30b8da7017bf7407068a4dc2ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/5fd943ae28089cef72e5a28f9ab081179f3439a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:21:36Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T22:21:36Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"feat(quality): hold web sources under a lint and format ceiling\n\nThe web workspace was type-checked, tested and built, but nothing linted its\nTypeScript and stylesheets or checked their layout. Biome 2.5.15 is pinned\nas an exact development dependency of the workspace (one package, lint and\nformat), configured in studio-web/biome.jsonc with the recommended rules;\none rule is off because wire records are read by their literal field names.\n\nThe sources were never formatted by a tool, so the gate does not demand a\nmass rewrite. tools/audit_web_source_ceiling.py measures every tracked .ts,\n.tsx and .css file and compares it with tools/web_source_ceiling.json: 686\nlint findings in 100 files and 171 unformatted files of 192 at this commit.\nA new file must be clean and formatted, a recorded file may not get worse,\nthe ceiling must be lowered when a file improves, and a file that differs\nfrom the comparison revision must be clean and formatted completely. A parse\nerror fails the gate; a release other than the pinned one is refused.\n\nRegistered as a step of the studio-web job after the locked install, in the\npre-push gates, the typing policy and the contributing guide. The source\nsurface inventory rows for .ts, .tsx and the workspace stylesheet are closed;\nthe new .jsonc kind is classified.\n\nValidation: 42 tests with the real Biome release and real Git repositories;\n229 statements and 94 branches covered except the script entry line, which\nthe job covers by running the script; strict typing, NumPy docstrings, lint\nand format; 234 policy and workflow tests; actionlint; inventory, licence\nand naming audits pass. No web source was changed.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"1173c8d8e95d6eb8970ebd1b70a82b5bbeb50558","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/1173c8d8e95d6eb8970ebd1b70a82b5bbeb50558"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/5fd943ae28089cef72e5a28f9ab081179f3439a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com