um.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"docs: correct the module counts in the architecture map and the index\n\nThe package has 780 Python source modules; both documents still said 774.\nThe architecture map counted 118 modules under phase and 83 under hardware;\nthe tree has 119 and 85. The inventory consistency tests compare these\nnumbers with the tree and failed on all four.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"3e114f0facc2fc2a91beb864d7e3685295672c28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/3e114f0facc2fc2a91beb864d7e3685295672c28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/3c1104b04eb7daf2d774893a6f208e633d2475bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/3c1104b04eb7daf2d774893a6f208e633d2475bb","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDNjMTEwNGIwNGViN2RhZjJkNzc0ODkzYTZmMjA4ZTYzM2QyNDc1YmI","parents":[{"html_u