22 documented\npublic module-level symbols.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"57775ef2b15797578b3688435b74c6bcca206416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/57775ef2b15797578b3688435b74c6bcca206416"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/e021e4b97d7efa6eed3e0639a16fd06f3fbb7dfe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/e021e4b97d7efa6eed3e0639a16fd06f3fbb7dfe","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGUwMjFlNGI5N2Q3ZWZhNmVlZDNlMDYzOWExNmZkMDZmM2ZiYjdkZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27","sha":"c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27"}],"sha":"e021e4b97d7efa6eed3e0639a16fd06f3fbb7dfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/e021e4b97d7efa6eed3e0639a16fd06f3fbb7dfe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:46:40Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:46:40Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(contracts): record plan successors instead of rewriting frozen fixtures\n\nOn 2026-10-03 the compile verb began to declare the program source and\ncompiler trace families. A plan carries the whole contract of its verb, and\nthe spine refuses a plan whose contract differs from it, so every compile\nplan changed and the two frozen compile plan fixtures stopped reproducing.\n\nThe frozen fixtures stay as they are. The change is recorded in\ntests/data/contract_custody_successors.json: per fixture, the grown list of\nproduced families and the digest of the whole successor. The replay derives\nthe expected successor from the frozen fixture and the record (the frozen\nfamilies first, at least one distinct family added, plan digest recomputed,\nrecorded digest matched) and compares it with the fresh output byte for\nbyte. Nothing in the fresh output is normalised; any other drift fails.\n\nNew tests: the successors differ from the frozen plans only in the two added\nfamilies and the plan digest; the replay rejects the superseded original, a\nfurther changed step or family, and a wrong digest; a record that reorders,\nremoves, repeats or adds nothing, misstates its digest, has another schema\nor repeats a fixture is refused.\n\nValidation: 168 tests in the replay helper, Studio executive and versioned\ncustody files; all 48 frozen corpus files unchanged; strict typing, NumPy\ndocstrings, lint and format; licence information complete.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"bb6b8a685cc1fc4e7f9a251a381c0b0db6a6400f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/bb6b8a685cc1fc4e7f9a251a381c0b0db6a6400f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGM0MGZlY2EwNjYwNDgxNjE5ZTM1YTlmZDVmNWRlZjZlNGRlZDJjMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476","sha":"d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476"}],"sha":"c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/c40feca0660481619e35a9fd5f5def6e4ded2c27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:46:28Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:46:28Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(program-ad): admit the identity matrix allocator in objectives\n\nThe effect admission introduced on 2026-10-02 refuses a call whose identity\nis not in the frozen list of pure callables. The list has the ones and zeros\nallocators but not the identity matrix, so the independent conformance oracle\nfor a moving repeated eigenvalue cluster, frozen on 2026-09-23, was refused\nbefore execution. The identity matrix is a constant allocator of the same\nkind and is added to the list.\n\nA new test differentiates the leading entry of I - v v^T for a unit vector\nv(t) and compares value and gradient with cos(t)^2 and -sin(2t) at two\nangles to 1e-14, and checks that no execution memory stays reserved.\n\nValidation: the conformance oracle passes at both angles; the dispatch test\nfile passes (8 tests); strict typing, NumPy docstrings, lint and format.\nParity: no other language holds this list. Benchmarks: not applicable, one\nlist entry and no numerical routine changed.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"b613f6d67dac147930cc683ca9eaf6b8ea2f928c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/b613f6d67dac147930cc683ca9eaf6b8ea2f928c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGQxMDQyZmMwMWM0NzRmMGY3ZmU4MjY3NmJmMWYxN2E0N2E4MmU0NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51","sha":"5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51"}],"sha":"d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/d1042fc01c474f0f7fe82676bf1f17a47a82e476"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:43:59Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:43:59Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(mlir): detach edited result copies from the captured tape\n\nSince results are bound to the tape they captured, an edited copy that keeps\nthe binding is refused as tampering. Six edited copies in the native quality\nedge tests dropped the adjoint but kept the binding, so four tests failed\nbefore reaching the lowering and compiler boundaries they exercise. The\ncopies now drop the binding together with the adjoint, through one helper.\n\nValidation: the 11 tests of the file pass; the whole lane (four test files)\nre-run locally with its exact coverage threshold; strict typing, NumPy\ndocstrings, lint and format on the file.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"ef02e4a4c20d253f2575e87677a09f79c7c4f808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/ef02e4a4c20d253f2575e87677a09f79c7c4f808"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKDVmMTYzMTUzMjViNmEwMDZjZjY0MjkzYTkxNTIwYzBkZjE0YmVkNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada","sha":"a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada"}],"sha":"5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/5f16315325b6a006cf64293a91520c0df14bed51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:33Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:13:33Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"test(coverage): restore exact coverage in five focused lanes\n\nFive lanes measured below their exact threshold while every test passed.\n\nResult pack and compile recompute lanes: the execute handler gained review\npreparation and the compile handler gained compiler trace evidence, each\nwith its own tests, but those test files were not in the lanes'' cohorts.\nThe cohorts now include them, in the helper lists and in the workflows.\n\nHardware abstraction lane: the export of an operator policy decision had no\ntest in the cohort. A new test checks the export of an admitted plan and of a\nrefused plan assessed without a price, field by field.\n\nChimera control lane: the lazy public facade''s refusal of an undeclared name\nand its listing were not exercised. A new test checks that every declared\nexport is the owning module''s object, that the listing is sorted and\ncomplete, and that an undeclared name is refused with the exact message.\n\nAdjoint replay lane: since results are bound to their captured tape, the two\nexisting refusal tests alter a bound result and are refused inside the call,\nso the checks after the call were no longer reached. Two new tests detach\nthe result first. These four tests replace the engine entry point, as the\nexisting ones do; the probe has a fixed objective and no other way in.\n\nValidation: the five lanes re-run locally with their own include patterns\nand thresholds reach 100 percent (73, 20, 133, 132 and 1,438 tests); 117\ngate and workflow contract tests; strict typing, NumPy docstrings, lint and\nformat on the changed files; actionlint and the workflow audits pass.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"8879868080f6884ed7f47ba03b3444a90a5a9dd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/8879868080f6884ed7f47ba03b3444a90a5a9dd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGE4ZWMyYjg2NjFlMmYyNzM3NjgzZDBjOWQ3YjEwMjI0OTdhYTRhZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/8b62b7552e30eed39c046a0d117d60d3a9696455","sha":"8b62b7552e30eed39c046a0d117d60d3a9696455","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/8b62b7552e30eed39c046a0d117d60d3a9696455"}],"sha":"a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/a8ec2b8661e2f2737683d0c9d7b1022497aa4ada"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/8b62b7552e30eed39c046a0d117d60d3a9696455/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:01:17Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:01:17Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(ci): install what the test cohorts execute and guard platform imports\n\nThe Studio browser cohort calls the native command line, which imports the\nStudio platform; the job installed the platform only in a later step. Install\nit with the other producer dependencies, once.\n\nThe competitive benchmark records the version of the installed distribution.\nThe focused job and the general test job ran from the source tree only, so\nthe installed case could not pass. Both now install the project in editable\nform, as the local environment does.\n\nThree operator review test modules imported the Studio platform without the\nguard the other Studio tests use; on Python 3.11, where the platform is not\navailable, the first of them stopped collection for the whole session.\n\nThe preview-rule test counted only commands written on one line and missed\ntwo folded commands in the core science workflow; it now counts a command in\nany layout. A new test binds the three installs to their jobs.\n\nValidation: 379 targeted tests (workflow contracts, the guarded modules, the\ncompetitive version cases, the result browser case without conftest);\ncollection of the whole suite with the platform made unimportable reports no\nerror; strict typing and NumPy docstring checks on the five test files;\nactionlint and the workflow audits pass.\n\nSeat: 90ad\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"b71b2f76b771ce2b98a741c10b605766e3805744","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/b71b2f76b771ce2b98a741c10b605766e3805744"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/8b62b7552e30eed39c046a0d117d60d3a9696455","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner