te":"2026-10-04T20:13:09Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(contracts): preserve original HAL evidence v1 fields\n\nRetain the original default profile bytes and refuse declared shot limits\nthat the v1 capture cannot represent. Exercise supplied local profiles\nand native shot admission while preserving the frozen custody corpus.\n\nSeat: 01a0f279\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"398ca5ac99268877469a06b285b5abdcc4b9bc49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/398ca5ac99268877469a06b285b5abdcc4b9bc49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/afb96f637344e914dfee083acc271018b91846b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/afb96f637344e914dfee083acc271018b91846b5","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGFmYjk2ZjYzNzM0NGU5MTRkZmVlMDgzYWNjMjcxMDE4YjkxODQ2YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"http