 licence expressions could not be parsed.\n\nAdd a gate that runs the pinned linter in CI and in the pre-push check,\nand bring the tree to zero findings: the test fixture directory gets an\nannotation, module federation diagnostics are ignored as tool output, and\nthe generator of the standalone review verifier and its test mark the\nemitted header as data so the linter does not read it as a licence tag of\nthe generator itself. The two marked files change by comments only.\n\nThe linter is pinned in a hash-locked requirement file constrained by the\nbase lock; four distributions are new, the shared ones keep their base\nversions. The linter now reports 5,606 of 5,606 files and no invalid\nexpression. No behaviour change.\n\nSeat: 90ad\n\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"bd87e2f6862efe653ae175639d521387e5bdd176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/bd87e2f6862efe653ae175639d521387e5bdd176"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/4d0023c06b85dc5f99070a3820424a4ff89acb83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_ur