och phase, unitary norm, independent Trotter refinement,\nphysical refusals, native dense/sparse XY kernels and both public dense entry points.\nExtend the existing phase-results CI quality cohort and update native API guides,\nstrict test registration and generated inventories. Existing evolution equations,\nRust kernels and browser models are unchanged; no isolated timing or stochastic,\nprovider, hardware or deployment qualification is claimed.\n\nSeat: 01a0f279\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"92efa42c3d4b181a61d6ad56aa7d144fb41e6b31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/92efa42c3d4b181a61d6ad56aa7d144fb41e6b31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/d2113b6e86872cff83e6287e4308df061b401fd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/d2113b6e86872cff83e6287e4308df061b401fd4","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGQyMT