e the dossier in Devices & Operations with exact native exports,\ncurrent expiry checks and execution-change invalidation.\n\nRetain declared native shot limits in the new review identity while\npreserving the original profile projection. Export a usable standalone\npayload verifier; neither review nor exports submit a provider job.\n\nPython and TypeScript contract parity is exercised in real Chromium with\nthe original WASM. Scoped native and UI coverage, strict types, native\ndocs and existing product guards pass. No numerical kernel changes or\nperformance claim; isolated benchmarks remain owner-deferred. Hosted\nacceptance remains separate; no full local suite or preflight ran.\n\nSeat: 01a0f279\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"772a7e80d1f9f078439a79f45c8ed0efa658df4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/772a7e80d1f9f078439a79f45c8ed0efa658df4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/b8677ee10f6d5c00178982460dc199840fa495b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum