comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T00:18:04Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"fix(studio): refuse native gate aliases during source export\n\nA custom gate named h could implement X while exporting as Hadamard. Validate\nits actual standard native class against the reimported compiler operation,\nincluding conditional blocks, before returning source. Refuse malformed\nmeasurement destinations with an authored export diagnostic.\n\nFive real SDK counterexamples cover custom and renamed gates, conditional\naliases and classical destinations without mutating the original circuit.\nAll 167 native Python cases pass; the three source owners retain 100% line and\nbranch coverage (381 statements, 134 branches). Strict types, native docs,\nlint and generated documentation checks pass. No numerical oracles change.\n\nSeat: 01a0f279\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"bb4e1a50ba5a2bcb4ff4542d621d1941d00a41b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/bb4e1a50ba5a2bcb4ff4542d621d1941d00a41b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/c7d5b1ea157cd82a3df236deed4f089ed1ad9e30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/c7d5b1ea157cd82a3df236deed4f089ed1ad9e30","node_id":"C_kwDORazOJtoAKGM3ZDViMWVhMTU3Y2Q4MmEzZGYyMzZkZWVkNGYwODllZDFhZDllMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commit/9ea967d52b22113d75171d47f467cfa0aa604fb4","sha":"9ea967d52b22113d75171d47f467cfa0aa604fb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/9ea967d52b22113d75171d47f467cfa0aa604fb4"}],"sha":"c7d5b1ea157cd82a3df236deed4f089ed1ad9e30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/c7d5b1ea157cd82a3df236deed4f089ed1ad9e30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/anulum","id":35185786,"login":"anulum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTg1Nzg2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/commits/9ea967d52b22113d75171d47f467cfa0aa604fb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:56:37Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:56:37Z","email":"protoscience@anulum.li","name":"Miroslav Šotek"},"message":"feat(studio): author supported programs and inspect source-bound IR\n\nAdd the Build program editor with structured operations and bounded OpenQASM2\nimport through real Rust/WASM. Preserve exact phase parameters, classical\nconditions, ordered readout and authored source locations. Draft edits discard\nstale results, retain immutable attempt history and export the original source.\nCompilation visibly reports emitted-not-executed.\n\nExtend the native Qiskit compile handler and exact native source export, and\nwire the shared browser scenario, owner gates and generated inventories into\nthe existing Studio CI category. Preserve the original XY/static qualifiers.\nFix long workbench badges and keep the IR and source views scrollable on mobile.\n\n69 shared source cases, 162 Python tests, 148 TypeScript tests, 25 native Rust\ncases and 8 real Chromium journey cases pass. Changed Python and TS owners and\nbrowser helper have exact 100% coverage; new Rust source has 100% lines,\nfunctions and regions. Strict types, native docs, Clippy and original consumers\npass. Normal hooks apply; hosted CI owns full validation.\n\nSeat: 01a0f279\nAuthored by Anulum Fortis & Arcane Sapience (protoscience@anulum.li)","tree":{"sha":"a3b1e2f9df445d1dde83a251a0ea37ab1c0b8b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/trees/a3b1e2f9df445d1dde83a251a0ea37ab1c0b8b33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anulum/scpn-quantum-control/git/commits/9ea967d52b22113d75171d47f467cfa0aa604fb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35185786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anulum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.