"email":"1054214757@qq.com","name":"rockyj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T08:18:02Z","email":"1054214757@qq.com","name":"rockyj"},"message":"feat: add role-based permissions, queue engine, and ticket workflows\n\nAdd role-based permission system with admin and agent roles.\nIntroduce unified queue engine supporting multiple assignment\nstrategies, channels, and timeout handling. Implement ticket\nworkflow builder with versioning and rollback. Add corresponding\nfrontend components and utility functions.","tree":{"sha":"11a4a5c0f052cd97865c26efb5d7bcf96ee069ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeepFlowAI/OpenDesk/git/trees/11a4a5c0f052cd97865c26efb5d7bcf96ee069ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeepFlowAI/OpenDesk/git/commits/61f7e23bf5e3669cfa5ae38e37ceb5fc9cd3ffab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21329014?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unhejing","id":21329014,"login":"unhejing","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMzI5MDE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unhejing","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DeepFlowAI/OpenDesk/commit/61f7e23bf5e3669cfa5ae38e37ceb5fc9cd3ffab","node_id":"C_kwDORbGKmdoAKDYxZjdlMjNiZjVl