i.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ShiQu1218","id":88728726,"login":"ShiQu1218","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NzI4NzI2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShiQu1218","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ShiQu1218/NeuroPen/commits/624beab2867b0446c28add27aa61281798af443a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T11:00:57Z","email":"wluis1218@gmail.com","name":"ShiQu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T11:00:57Z","email":"wluis1218@gmail.com","name":"ShiQu"},"message":"fix: stop touching clipboard in background selection watcher and QA flow\n\n  The clipboard fallback in the selection watcher (capture_selection_snapshot_via_clipboard)\n  and the proactive triggerHotkey() call when showing the QA icon both modified the clipboard\n  without user action, racing with manual Ctrl+C and destroying non-text content (screenshots,\n  images) via EmptyClipboard().\n\n  - Remove clipboard fallback from selection watcher entirely (UIA-only)\n  - Add lock_window command: locks foreground window without touching clipboard\n  - QA icon show path uses lock_window instead of trigger_hotkey\n  - Remove restore_clipboard calls from QA action flow (nothing cached)\n  - Remove now-unused simulate_ctrl_c() wrapper\n\n  The hotkey-initiated flow (hotkey://press) still caches and restore